<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">ACT- Goofa</book>
  <para style="h">Hawaareta Oosuwa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ha@O</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hawaareta Oosuwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hawaareta Oosuwa</para>
  <para style="mt">Hawaareta Oosuwa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaareta ooso maxaafay Luuqaasa Wonggelaa kaallidi xaafettida maxaafaa. Maxaafas de7iya waanna qofay koyro Yesuusa kaallida asati Geeshsha Ayyaanay kaalethin, iyabaa odiya qaala, “Yerusalaamen, Yihuda biitta ubban, Samaaren, sa7aa gaxappe gaxa gakkanaw” (1:8) wonggelaa biitta ubbaa waati gathidaakko odanaassa. Maxaafay ammanoy Ayhude asata giddon doomettidi, kumetha alamen de7iya asa ubbaa ammano gidana gakkanaw waanidi dalggidaakko odiya taarike. Ha maxaafaa xaafey, ammaniyaa asati Roome kawotethaa kunddisanaw garssara maqettiya asi gidonnayssanne ammanoy Ayhudeta haymaanote polo oothiyssa gideyssa erisanaw keehi daaburidi oothis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaareta ooso maxaafay, Yesuusabaa odiya Wonggelay gakkiya bessay woden woden dalggi dalggi beyssanne woosa keethi eqqidayssa qonccisiya heedzu ayfe kifiletan shaakkanaw dandda7ettees:</para>
  <para style="ip">1@ Ammanoy Yesuusi salo keyi simmin doomettidayssa.</para>
  <para style="ip">2@ Ammanoy Isra7eele biitta ubbaa gakkidayssa.</para>
  <para style="ip">3@ Roome gujjidi Meditiraane Abbaa yuushuwan de7iya biitta ubban dalggidayssa bessees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaareta ooso maxaafan aadhdhidi benttey Geeshsha Ayyaana ooso gidishin, Phenxeqosxe gallas Yerusalaamen de7iya ammaneyssata bolla wolqqara wodhdhidayssa odees. Hessadakka, maxaafaa giddon qonccida oosota ubban benttidayssada Geeshsha Ayyaanay woosa keethaanne woosa keethaa ayseyssata kaalethidayssanne minthethidayssa gujjidi odees. Beni wode imettiya ammano kiitay dumma dumma odettida qaalappe keson keson ekettis. Hawaareta oosuwa giddon oosettida oosota kiitay ammaniyaa asaa de7oninne woosa keetha issifetethan de7iya wolqqay ay mela giteekko bessees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Hawaareta oosuwa ayfe qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Markkatethas giigetethi 1:1-26</para>
  <para style="io2">1) Yesuusa wurssetha kiitaanne immida ufayssaa 1:1-14</para>
  <para style="io2">2) Yihuda bessan haraa dooruwa 1:15-26</para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusalaamen markkatethi 2:1-8:3</para>
  <para style="io1">Yihudaninne Samaaren markkatethi 8:4-12:25</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa hawaaretetha oosuwa 13:1-28:31</para>
  <para style="io2">1) Koyro hawaaretetha buussaa 13:1-14:28</para>
  <para style="io2">2) Yerusalaame shiiquwa 15:1-35</para>
  <para style="io2">3) Nam77antho hawaaretetha buussaa 15:36-18:22</para>
  <para style="io2">4) Heedzantho hawaaretetha buussaa 18:23-21:16</para>
  <para style="io2">5) Phawuloosi Yerusalaamen, Qisaariyaninne Roomen qashetethaa 21:17-28:31</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v"/>Tewofiloosa, Yesuusi ba oosuwa oykkida wodeppe salo bida gallasaa gakkanaw, oothidabaanne tamaarssidabaa ubbaa taani ta koyro maxaafan xaafas. Salo baanappe sinthe I ba doorida hawaareta Geeshsha Ayyaanan kiittis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">Luuqa 1:1-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>I ba waayiyappe guye hayqoppe denddidayssa sidhey baynna qonccisidi enttaw bana bessis. Oytamu gallas enttaw qonccidi Xoossaa kawotethaabaa entta tamaarssis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Issi wode enttara issife mishe entta hayssada yaagidi kiittis; “Ta hinttew odida, ta Aaway immana gida ufayssaa qaala naagiteppe attin Yerusalaameppe keyoppite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Luuqa 24:49</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ays giikko, Yohaannisi haathan xammaqis, shin guutha wodeppe guye Geeshsha Ayyaanan hintte xammaqettana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Maato 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:8">Mar 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luuqa 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:33">Yoha 1:33</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hawaareti Yesuusara gayttida wode iyaakko, “Godaw, Isra7eeletas ne kawotethaa zaarana wodey hayssee?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Ta Aaway ba maatan oothiya wodiyanne laythaa hintte eranaw dandda7ekketa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shin Geeshsha Ayyaanay hintte bolla wodhdhiya wode, hintte wolqqan kumana. Yaani simmidi, Yerusalaamen, Yihuda biitta ubban, Samaareninne sa7aa gaxa gakkanaw taw markkatta gidana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Maato 28:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:15">Mar 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47-48">Luuqa 24:47-48</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hessa gidayssafe guye entti xeellishin, dhoqqu dhoqqu gidi, saluwa bin shaaraykka iya entta ayfiyaappe geenthis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mar 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-51">Luuqa 24:50-51</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusi biya wode entti salo tishshi oothidi xeellishin, bootha ma7o ma77ida nam77u asati akeekonna entta matan eqqidi, <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Galiila asato, salo xeellishe, hintte ays eqqideti? Ha hintte be7ishin salo bida Yesuusi hessadakka simmidi yaana” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yihuda bessan Maatiyasi doorettis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Maato 27:3-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, hawaareti Shamaho Deriyappe Yerusalaame simmidosona. Shamaho Derey Yerusalaames matan de7ees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Entti Yerusalaame gelidi, bantta de7iya bessaa pooqiya bolla keyidosona. Enttika: Phexiroosa, Yohaannisa, Yayqooba, Inddiriyasa, Filiphphoosa, Toomasa, Bartolomiyoosa, Maatoosa, Ilfiyoosa na7aa Yayqooba, ba biittaas mishettiya Simoonanne Yayqooba na7aa Yihuda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Maato 10:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:16-19">Mar 3:16-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:14-16">Luuqa 6:14-16</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hayssati ubbay maccasatara, Yesuusa aaye Mayraamiranne Yesuusa ishatara ubbay issi wozanan gididi minthidi woossosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>He wode, Phexiroosi xeetanne laatama gidiya ammaniyaa asay shiiqida bessan denddi eqqidi, hayssada yaagis: <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Asaw, Yesuusa oykkidayssata kaalethida Yihudabaa Geeshsha Ayyaanay kase Dawite doonan odida Xoossaa qaalay polettanaw bessees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yihudi nuura issife ha oosuwa oothanaw doorettida asi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Shin Yihudi ba iita oosuwan demmida miishen gade shammis. I gufannidi kunddin, iya uloy daakettis; iya maraacey ubbay kare keyis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yihuda bolla hanidabaa Yerusalaamen de7iya asa ubbay si7is. Hessa gisho, he gadiya bantta qaalan Akelddaama (Suutha gade) gidi xeegidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Hessika mazmure maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Iya keethay kallo atto;</para>
  <para style="q2">oonikka iyan de7oppo.</para>
  <para style="q1">Qassi iya shuumatethaa hari ekko’ geetetti xaafettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:25">Maz 69:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:8">109:8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, Godaa Yesuusi nu giddon simerettida wode ubban nuura de7eyssatappe, <verse number="22" style="v"/>qassi Xammaqiya Yohaannisa wodiyappe doomidi Godaa Yesuusi salo bida gallas gakkanaw nuura de7eyssatappe issi asi iya dendduwas nuura markka gidanaw bessees” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:16">Maato 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9">Mar 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luuqa 3:21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, asay dooruwas Yosxoosa giya Barssaabasa geetettiya Yoosefanne Maatiyasa nam77a shiishidosona. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Xoossaa woossishe, “Asa ubbaa wozana eriya Godaw, ha nam77atappe ne oona dooridaakko nuna bessa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yihudi ba bessaa bidi, aggida oosuwanne hawaaretetha oosuwa ekkana mela hayssatappe nuus qonccisa” yaagidosona. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Entta bolla saama yeggidosona. Saamay Maatiyasa bolla wodhdhin Maatiyasi tammanne issi hawaareta bolla guzhettis.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Geeshsha ayyaanaa yuusaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Phenxeqosxe giya gallasay gakkida wode ammaniyaa asa ubbay issife issi bessan shiiqidi de7oosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Leewe 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Zaare 16:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Qopponna wolqqaama goteda guummiya guunthay akeekonna saloppe yidi entti de7iya keethaa kumis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Qassi tama laco daaniya inxarssati enttaw benttishe, shaaketti shaaketti entta ubbaa bolla wodhdhidosona. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Entti ubbay Geeshsha Ayyaanan kumidi dumma dumma doonan odettana mela Geeshsha Ayyaanay entta dandda7isin haasaya doomidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>He wode biitta ubbaafe yida Xoossaa yayyiya Ayhudeti Yerusalaamen de7oosona. <verse number="6" style="v"/>He guunthaa si7ida wode daro asay shiiqidosona. Ammaniya asay entta qaalan odettishin si7ida gisho, <verse number="7" style="v"/>malaalettidi, “Ha odettiya asay ubbay Galiila ase gidokkonaayye? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yaatin, nuuni, nu yelettida biittaa doonan entti odettishin waanidi si7anaw dandda7ido? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nuuni Pharxen, Meedonan, Elaamen, nam77u shaafatappe giddon de7eyssati, Yihudan, Qaphadooqiyan, Phanxoosan, Iisiyan, <verse number="10" style="v"/>Firgen, Phinfilen, Gibxen, Qarena matan de7iya Liibiyan de7eyssata. Nuuppe baggatikka Roomeppe yida asata. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ayhudetinne Ayhudetetha ammano gelida asati, Qarxeesenne Arabe asati, Xoossay oothida gita oosuwa nu qaalan odettishin si7oos” yaagidosona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ubbay malaalettidi, gaanabaa dhayidi wolikko, “La hayssi ay guussee?” yaagidosona. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin harati, “Hayssati uyidi mathottidosona” yaagidi qelqisidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phexiroosa haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosi, tammanne issi hawaaretara denddi eqqidi, ba qaala dhoqqu oothidi, enttaw hayssada yaagidi odis; “Ayhudetoo, Yerusalaamen de7iya ubbato, taani odeyssa si7ite. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wonttafe heedzu saate gidiya gisho hintte qoppeyssada ha asati mathottibookkona; hessi hinttew eretto. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Shin hayssi haniday nabiya Iyu7eeli odidayssi polettana melassa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“ ‘Xoossay, wodiya wurssethan hayssada hanana yaagees:</para>
  <para style="q2">taani asa ubbaa bolla ta Ayyaana gussana.</para>
  <para style="q1">Hintte adde naytinne macca nayti,</para>
  <para style="q2">tinbbite odettana.</para>
  <para style="q1">Hintte yalagati qonccethi be7ana;</para>
  <para style="q2">hintte cimati amuho amuhana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17-21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Iyu 2:28-32</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>He gallasatan tana ammaniyaa adde aylleta bollanne macca aylleta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2">taani ta Ayyaana gussana;</para>
  <para style="q2">entti tinbbite odana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Qassi taani bolla saluwan oorathabaa,</para>
  <para style="q2">garssa sa7ankka malla bessana.</para>
  <para style="q1">Suuthay, tamaynne wolqqaama caaganay benttana.</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gitanne bonchcho gidida Godaa gallasay</para>
  <para style="q">gakkanaappe sinthe away dhumana;</para>
  <para style="q2">ageenaykka suuthi daanana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>He wode hessada hanana;</para>
  <para style="q2">Godaa sunthaa xeegiya oonikka attana’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Isra7eele asato, ha qaala si7ite. Naazirete Yesuusa oonatethay, Xoossay hintte giddon oothida wolqqaama oosuwaninne malaatatan hinttew qonccoyssa hinttee, hintte huu7en ereeta. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Xoossaa kase eraninne iya sheniyan Yesuusi hinttew aadhdhi imettis. Hintte iya nagaranchchoti masqaliya bolla kaqqidi wodhana mela aathi immideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:35">Maato 27:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:24">Mar 15:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:33">Luuqa 23:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:18">Yoha 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v"/>Shin Xoossay hayqo wolqqaa diggidi iya denthis. Hessa gisho, hayqoy iya oykkanaw dandda7ibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:5-6">Maato 28:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:6">Mar 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:5">Luuqa 24:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v"/>Dawitey iyabaa odishe,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Taani yarkkonna mela,</para>
  <para style="q2">Goday ta ushachchan de7ees.</para>
  <para style="q2">Goday ubba wode ta matan be7ays.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ta wozanay ufayttis;</para>
  <para style="q2">ta inxarssan ufayssi kumis;</para>
  <para style="q2">hayqqiya ta asatethay ufayssan daana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ays giikko, ta shemppuwa Si7oolen aggaka.</para>
  <para style="q2">Qassi ne Geeshsha Na7aa ahaa wooqisakka.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Neeni tana de7o ogiya erisadasa.</para>
  <para style="q2">Neeni taara de7eyssan ta ufayssay kumethi gidees’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Maz 16:8-11</ref></char></note> yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Asaw, nu aawa Dawitebaa ta hinttew geeshshada odana. Dawitey hayqqidi moogettis; iya duufoy hachchi gakkanaw nu matan de7ees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Dawitey nabe gidida gisho Xoossay iya sheeshaappe issuwa iya kawotethaa araata bolla utisanaw iyaw caaqqida caaquwa erees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:11">Maz 132:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2Saamu 7:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Kiristtoosa dendduwa sinthe xeellidi, ‘Iya shemppoy Si7oolen attibeenna; iya asatethaykka wooqibeenna’ gidi odis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Xoossay, ha Yesuusa hayquwappe denthidayssas nuuni ubbay markka. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossay baara haarana mela baappe ushachcha baggara iya dhoqqu dhoqqu oothidi, iyaw immana geetettida Geeshsha Ayyaana ekkidi, hayssa hintte ha77i be7eyssanne si7eyssa nu bolla gussis. <verse number="34-35" style="v"/>Gaasoykka, Dawitey ba huu7en salo bibeenna shin yaagis:</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Goday, ta Godaa, “Taani ne morkketa</para>
  <para style="q2">ne tohoy yedhdhiyaso oothana gakkanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hayssan taappe ushachcha baggara utta” gis’</para>
  <para style="m">yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34-35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz 110:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, ha hintte masqaliya bolla kaqqida Yesuusa Xoossay Godanne Kiristtoosa oothidayssa Isra7eele asa ubbay tumappe ero” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Asay Phexiroosi gidayssa si7ida wode asay bantta wozanan boshettidi Phexiroosanne hankko hawaaretakko, “Ishato, yaatin nuuni ay oothinoo?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Phexiroosi enttako, “Hintte nagaray atto geetettana mela nagaraappe simmidi, hintte issoy issoy Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthan xammaqetite. Xoossay immiya Geeshsha Ayyaana hintte ekkana. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Gaasoykka Xoossay immana gida ufayssa qaalay hinttes, hintte naytasinne Goday nu Xoossay baakko xeegiya haahon de7iya ubbaassa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Phexiroosi enttaw hara qaalakka gujji markkattidi, “Ha wodiya geella asaa bolla yaanaw de7iya pirddafe hintte huu7iya ashshite” yaagidi zoris. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Phexiroosi odidayssa ekkidayssati xammaqettidosona. He gallas heedzu mukulu gidiya asay ammanidosona. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Entti hawaareta timirttiyan, issifetethan, uythaa muusaninne Xoossaa woosan minnoosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Ammaniya asaa issifetetha de7uwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Hawaareta kushen daro oorathabaynne malaati oosettiya gisho asa ubbay yayyidosona. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ammanida ubbay issife de7oosona; banttaw de7iyaba ubbaa issife shaakettoosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:32-35">Ha@O 4:32-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="45" style="v"/>Entti banttaw de7iyabaa bayzidi miishiya issuwas issuwas koshshida mela shaakkosona. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ubba gallas issi wozanan gididi Xoossa Keethan shiiqoosona. Bantta keethan issoy issuwa xeegidi ufayssaninne ashkke wozanan kathaa moosona. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Xoossaa galatishe asa ubban sabettidosona. Goday atteyssata gallas gallas entta bolla gujjees.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Wobbe addey Paxis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Issi gallas Phexiroosinne Yohaannisi Xoossaa woossanaw uddufun saaten Xoossa Keethi bidosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yelettoosoppe doomidi wobbe gidida issi addey Xoossa Keethi geliya asaappe miishe woossana mela ubba gallas lo77o giya Xoossa Keethaa penggiyan ehidi wothoosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>He wobbe addey Phexiroosinne Yohaannisi Xoossa Keethi gelana hanishin be7idi entta miishe woossis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Enttika iya caddi xeellidi, “Nuukko haa xeella” yaagidosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wobbe addey enttafe aykko ekkana daanin enttako xeellis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosi iyaakko, “Taw miishey baawa, shin taw de7iyabaa taani new immana. Naazirete Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthan denddada hamutta” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, wobbe addiya ushachcha kushiya oykkidi denthis. Ellesidi iya tohoynne qinccafiley minni aggis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Addey guppidi denddi eqqis. Gedenne ha hamuthi doomis. Hessafe guye, hamuttishe, guppishenne Xoossaa galatishe enttara issife Xoossa Keethi gelis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>I hamuttishininne Xoossaa galatishin asay ubbay iya be7idosona. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Be7ida ubbay miishe woossanaw lo77o giya Xoossa Keetha penggen uttidayssi iya gididayssa eridosona; I hanidabaa be7idi malaalettidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phexiroosi Xoossa Keethan haasayida haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Addey Phexiroosappenne Yohaannisappe duuxike gidi oykkidi de7ishin asay ubbay malaalettidi, Solomone barandda giyason issife enttako woxxidosona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Phexiroosi asaa be7ida wode asaakko, “Isra7eele asato, ays hayssan malaaletteti? Woykko ays nuna caddi xeelletii? Nuuni nu wolqqan woykko nu xillotethan ha addiya hamuthidabaa hinttew daanii? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Abrahaame, Yisaaqa, Yayqooba Xoossay, nu aawata Xoossay, ba na7aa Yesuusa bonchchis. Shin hintte hayqos aathi immidayssa Philaaxoosi billanaw koyinkka hintte iya sinthan, ‘Nuuni iya erokko’ yaagideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:15">Kessa 3:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hintte geeshshaanne xilluwaa, ‘Nuuni iya erokko’ gidi, shemppo wodhidayssa hinttew billana mela Philaaxoosa woossideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:15-23">Maato 27:15-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-14">Mar 15:6-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-23">Luuqa 23:13-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:12-15">Yoha 19:12-15</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v"/>De7uwa immeyssa hintte wodhideta, shin Xoossay hayqoppe iya denthis. Hessas nuuni markka. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ha hintte be7eysinne eriya addey paxidi minniday Yesuusa sunthan ammanidayssana. Ha hintte ubbaa sinthan iya hayssada pathiday I Yesuusa ammanida gishossa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Ha77ika ta ishato, hintteka hinttena kaaletheyssatada, eronna oothidayssa taani erays. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Shin Xoossay beni nabeta ubbaa doonan, ‘Kiristtoosi waaye ekkanaw bessees’ yaagidayssi hayssada polettana mela oothis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hiza, Xoossay hintte nagara atto gaana mela Godaakko simmite. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Godaa matappe minthetho wodey hinttew yaana. Xoossay Kiristtoosa gidana mela sinthattidi doorida Yesuusa hinttew yeddana. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Xoossay ba geeshsha nabeta doonan beni odidayssa mela ubbabay ooraxiya wodey gakkanaw Yesuusi salon gam77anaw bessees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Musey, ‘Goday Xoossay tana denthidayssa mela hintte giddofe hinttew nabe denthana. Hintte I geyssa ubbaa si7ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Zaare 18:15</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v"/>He nabey odeyssa si7onna asi oonikka asaa giddofe shaakettidi dhayo’ yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:19">Zaare 18:19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Qassi Saamu7eelappe doomidi de7iya nabeti ubbay ha wodiyaba odidosona. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hintte nabeta nayta; qassi Xoossay Abrahames, ‘Sa7an de7iya asa ubbaa taani ne sheeshaa baggara anjjana’ yaagidi nu aawatas gelida qaala laattiya nayta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Medhe 22:18</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v"/>Xoossay hinttena ubbaa hintte iita ogiyappe zaaridi anjjana mela ba na7aa denthidi hinttew koyro yeddis” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phexiroosinne Yohaannisi Ayhude Shanggo sinthan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Phexiroosinne Yohaannisi asaas odishin kahine halaqati, Xoossa Keethaa naageyssata halaqaynne Saduqaaweti enttako yidosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Entti Yesuusi hayqoppe denddoyssanne iya gaason hayqoppe denddoy de7eyssa asaa tamaarssida gisho yilotidosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, entta oykkidi sa7ay omarssida gisho wonttana gakkanaw qasho keethi gelssidosona. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Shin qaala si7idayssatappe daroti ammanidosona. Ammanida adde asaa tayboy ichchashu mukulukko bis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Wonttetha gallas deriya haareyssati, cimatinne, higge asttamaareti Yerusalaamen shiiqidosona. <verse number="6" style="v"/>He asa giddon kahine halaqay Haanni, Qayyaafi, Yohaannisi, Iskkinddirosinne kahine halaqaa soo asati ubbay de7oosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hawaareta bantta sinthan essidi, “Aybi wolqqan woykko oode sunthan hayssa hintte oothidetii?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>He wode Phexiroosi Geeshsha Ayyaanan kumidi, “Deriya haareyssato, cimatoo, <verse number="9" style="v"/>hachchi ha wobbe addiyaas oosettida lo77o oosuwasinne I waanidi paxidaakko hintte nuna oychchiko, <verse number="10" style="v"/>masqaliya bolla hintte kaqqin, Xoossay hayqoppe denthida Naazirete Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthan ha addey paxidi hintte sinthan eqqidayssi hinttewunne Isra7eele asa ubbaas eretto.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>‘Gimbbeyssati boridi ixxida shuchchay,</para>
  <para style="q2">godaa xaphuwa minthiya,</para>
  <para style="q2">ubbaafe aadhdhiya shuchchu gidis;</para>
  <para style="q1">he shuchchay Yesuusa.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Maz 118:22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, atotethi iya baggarappe attin hara oode baggarakka baawa. Nuuni iya sunthan attana mela asa ubbaas Xoossay saloppe garssan immida hara sunthi baawa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shiiqida asay Phexiroosinne Yohaannisi minnida minotethaa be7ida wode entti tamaariboonna coo asi gididayssa akeekidi malaalettidosona; entti Yesuusara de7eyssa eridosona. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Qassi paxida addey Phexiroosaranne Yohaannisara eqqidayssa asay be7idi giyabaa dhayidosona. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosanne Yohaannisa kare keyana mela oothidi bantta giddon, <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Ha asata nu ay oothinoo? Entta kushen oosettida gita malaatay Yerusalaamen de7iya ubbaas benttees. Nuuni hessa erokko gaanaw dandda7okko. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Shin ha oday asaa giddon laalettonna mela hizappe guye ha asati Yesuusa sunthan oodeskka odonna mela minthidi naagisana” yaagidi zorettidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Entta xeegidi, Yesuusa sunthan hizappe odonna mela woykko tamaarssonna mela kiittidosona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosinne Yohaannisi enttako zaaridi, “Xoossas kiitettanayssafenne hinttew kiitetanayssafe Xoossaa sinthan awussi lo77oko ane hintte pirddite. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nuuni be7idabaanne si7idabaa odonna agganaw dandda7okko” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Biitta cimatinne deriya haareyssati kaseppe minthi naagisidi entta yeddi aggidosona. Asay hanidabaas Xoossaa galatiya gisho entta seeranaw dandda7ibookkona. <verse number="22" style="v"/>He malaatan harggiyafe pathida addiyaas laythay oytamappe aadhdhis.</para>
  <para style="s">Ammaniya asaa woosaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Phexiroosinne Yohaannisi birshshettidi bantta dabbotakko bidi, kahine halaqatinne cimati banttako gidabaa ubbaa enttaw odidosona. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Entti hessa si7ida wode issi wozanan gididi Xoossaa hayssada yaagidi woossidosona: “Ubbaa Haariya Godaw, saluwa, sa7aa, abbaanne entta giddon de7iya ubbabaa medhdhidaysso,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Kessa 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:6">Nah 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Maz 146:6</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v"/>Neeni ne aylliya, nu aawa Dawite doonan Geeshsha Ayyaanan,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Derey ays yilotidonaa?</para>
  <para style="q2">Asay ays coo maqettidonaa?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1-2">Maz 2:1-2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Sa7aa kawotinne</para>
  <para style="q2">deriya haareyssati issife Godaa bollanne</para>
  <para style="q2">Kiristtoosa bolla denddidosona’ yaagadasa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Tumakka, Heerodisinne Phenxe Philaaxoosi Ayhude gidonna asaaranne Isra7eele asaara ne doorida ne geeshsha Na7aa Yesuusa bolla denddanaw ha kataman shiiqidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Maato 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luuqa 23:1</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:7-11">7-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-29">Yoha 18:28-29</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v"/>Qassi neeni ne wolqqaaninne ne sheniyan oothana gada qoppa uttidabaa ubbaa polidosona. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ha77ika Godaw, entta manddethaa be7a; nuuni ne aylleti ne qaala kumetha wozanan odana mela nuna dandda7isa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ne geeshsha na7aa Yesuusa sunthan hargganchchota pathanaw, oorathabaynne malaatati oosettana mela ne kushiya micca” gidi woossidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Entti Xoossaa woossidaappe guye he entti shiiqidasoy qaaxxis. Entta ubban Geeshsha Ayyaanay kumin Xoossaa qaala minotethan odidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Koyro ammanida asaa issifetethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ammaneysati ubbay qofaninne wozanan issino gididosona. Entti banttaw de7iyabaa tabaa goonnashin issife shaakettoosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:44-45">Ha@O 2:44-45</ref></char></note> <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hawaarti Godaa Yesuusi hayqoppe denddidayssa gita wolqqan markkattosona. Xoossay entta ubbaas aadho keehatethaa darssidi immis. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Biitti woykko keethi de7eyssati ubbay bayzi ekkida miishiya ehiya gisho ammaneyssata giddon metootanchchoy issoykka baawa. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Miishiya ehidi hawaaretas immoosona; he miishiya asaas koshshidayssada issuwas issuwas shaakki shaakki immees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Qoophirosa giya bessan yelettida Yoosefa giya Leewi sheeshaappe gidida issoy de7ees. Iya sunthaa hawaareti Barnnabaasa (Minthetho na7a) gidosona. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Barnnabaasi baw de7iya biittaa bayzidi miishiya ehidi hawaaretas immis.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Hananiyanne iya machchiw Saphphiiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Issi Hananiya giya addey ba machche Saphphiirira gade bayzis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>He bayzida miishiyappe ba machchiya erishin baggaa ashshidi, attidayssa ehidi hawaaretas immis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosi Hananiyakko, “Neeni Geeshsha Ayyaana cimmana melanne gadiya bayzida miishiyappe shaakkada ashshana mela Xalahey ne wozanan ays gelidee? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Neeni bayzanaappe kase gadey nebaa gidenneyye? Qassi neeni bayza simminkka miishey nebaa gidenneyye? Yaatin, hessa melabaa oothanaw ays ne wozanan qoppadii? Neeni Xoossaa bolla worddotadasappe attin asa bolla worddotabaakka” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hananey he qaala si7ida mela kunddidi hayqqis; hessa si7ida ubbay daro yayyis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Naatethaa asati soo gelidi iya ahaa xaaxidi efidi moogidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Heedzu saateppe guye Hananiya machchiya hessa eronna de7ashe Phexiroosi de7iyasuwa gelasu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Phexiroosi iikko, “Hintte gadiya hayssa mela miishes bayzideti? Ane taw oda” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Iyakka, “Ee, hayssa mela miishes bayzida” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Phexiroosi maccasiw, “Neeranne ne azinaara Godaa Ayyaana paaccanaw ays zorettidetii? Hekko, ne azina moogida asati karen de7oosona; nenakka entti kare kessana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Maccasiya iirakka Phexiroosa tohuwa matan kunddada hayqqa aggasu; na7atethati geliya wode hayqqidaaro demmidi kare kessidi, I azina matan moogidosona. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kumetha woosa keethaynne hessa si7ida hara asay ubbay daro yayyidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Oorathabatanne malaalisiyabata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hawaareti daro malaatatanne oorathabata asaa giddon oothoosona. Ammaniya ubbay Solomone baaranddan issife shiiqosona. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hara asappe enttara gayttanaw issi asikka minnibeenna, shin asay entta bonchchees. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ammaniya addetanne maccasata tayboy kaseyssafe darishe bis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, asay hargganchchota halaninne alggan tookkidi Phexiroosi aadhdhiya wode iya kuyay enttafe issota issota bolla shemppana mela oge doonan kessidi wothoosona. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Qassi daro asay Yerusalaame matan de7iya katamatappe hargganchchotanne tuna ayyaanay waaysiya asata ekkidi yoosona; ubbayka paxidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Hawaareta bolla goodi denddis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kahine halaqaynne iyara de7iya Saduqaaweti ubbay qanaaten kumidi hawaareta bolla denddidosona. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hawaareta oykkidi deriya qasho keethan yeggidosona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Shin Godaa kiitanchchoy qamma qasho keethaa penggiya dooyidi hawaareta kare kessidi, <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Bidi, Xoossa Keethan eqqidi ha ooratha de7o qaala asa ubbaa odite” yaagis. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hawaareti hessa si7ida wode wontta guura Xoossa Keethi gelidi tamaarsso doomidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Kahineta halaqaynne iyara de7eyssati yidi, Isra7eele cimata ubbaa xeegi shiishidi hawaareta bantta sinthe ehana mela wotaaddareta qasho keethi kiittidosona. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin wotaaddareti qasho keethi bidi hawaareta demmibookkona. Guye simmi yidi deriyas, <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Nuuni biya wode qasho keetha penggey minthi gorddettin, naageyssati penggen eqqidayssata demmida. Shin nuuni kariya dooyiya wode giddon hari attoshin issi asikka baawa” yaagidosona. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossa Keethaa wotaaddareta kiitteysinne kahine halaqati hessa si7ida wode, “Hawaareta bolla aybi haanidee?” yaagidi hirggidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>He wode issi addey enttako yidi, “Hekko, qasho keethi hintte gelssida asati Xoossa Keethan eqqidi asaa tamaarssoosona” yaagidi enttaw odis. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Xoossa Keethaa wotaaddareta kiitteyssi ba wotaaddaretara bidi hawaareta ehis. Shin entti bantana asay shuchchan caddana gidi yayyida gisho entta aaddashidi ehidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Entti hawaareta ehidi, shiiqida shangguwa sinthan essin kahine halaqay enttako, <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Hinttena nuuni he uraa sunthan tamaarssonna mela minthidi kiittibookko? Hekko, hintte timirttiya Yerusalaame katamaa ubbaa gathideta. He uraa shemppuwas nuna oythanaw qoppeeti?” yaagidi oychchis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Maato 27:25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Phexiroosaranne hankko hawaaretara enttaw zaarishe, “Nuuni asas kiitettanaappe Xoossas kiitettanaw bessees. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Masqaliya bolla hintte kaqqidi wodhida Yesuusa nu aawata Xoossay hayqoppe denthis. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Isra7eeleti nagaraappe simmana melanne entta nagaray atto geetettana mela Xoossay Yesuusa haareyssanne ashsheyssa oothidi bonchchon baappe ushachcha baggan utisis. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hessas nuuni markka; qassi Xoossay bana ammaneyssatas immida Geeshsha Ayyaanaykka markka” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Shiiqida asay hessa si7ida wode daro yilottidi, hawaareta wodhanaw qoppidosona. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Shin asa ubban daro bonchchettida Gamaaliyale geetetteyssi issi higge asttamaareynne Farisaawey denddi eqqidi hawaareta guutha wodes kare kessana mela kiittis. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, shiiqida asaakko, “Isra7eele asato, ha asata bolla hintte oothanaw qoppiyabaappe naagettite. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ays giikko, hayssafe kase Tewodaasi bana, ‘Taani gita’ gidi denddin, oyddu xeetu gidiya asati iyara issifidosona. Shin iya wodhin iya kaallida ubbay laalettin pathonna asi gididi attidosona. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, asay taybettiya wode Galiila Yihudi denddidi daro asa panggayidi kaalethis, shin iyakka wodhin iya kaallida asay ubbay laalettis. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ha77ika ta hinttew odays; ha asatappe shaakettite; entta bochchofite. Ays giikko, ha qofaanne ha oosuwa asi oothiyabaa gidikko dhayana. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Shin ha qofaynne ha oosoy Xoossafe yidabaa gidikko, hintte entta dhayssanaw dandda7ekketa. Geellada yaanishe hintte Xoossaara kaccettana” yaagidi odis. Hessa gisho, shiiqida asay Gamaaliyale zoriya ekkidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hawaareta soo xeegidi lisson garaafisis. Hessafe guye, enttako, “Yesuusa sunthaa nam77antho denthofite” gidi birshshi yeddidosona. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesuusa sunthaa gisho, entti kawuyanayssi bessiyabaa gideyssa erida gisho shangguwa sinthafe ufayttishe keyidosona. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Entti ubba gallas Xoossa keethan asa son Yesuusi I Kiristtoosa gideyssa tamaarssonne sabbako aggibookona.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Laappun asata dooretethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He wode kaalleyssata tayboy dari dari bishin, Girike doona odettiya Ayhudeti Yihudan yelettidi de7iya Ayhudeta bolla zuuzummidosona. Ays giikko, Girike doona odettiya Ayhudeti, “Gallas gallas imettiya kathan nu am77eti naaqettosona” yaagidosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tammanne nam77u hawaareti woosa keethaa asa ubbaa xeegidi, “Nuuni Xoossaa qaala odeyssa aggidi kathi gishanaw nuus bessenna. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hiza, ishato, lo77o asata, Geeshsha Ayyaananinne cinccatethan kumida laappun asata hintte giddofe doorite; nuuni entta ha oosuwas shuumana. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Shin nuuni, nu kumetha wodiya Xoossaa woosaninne qaala tamaarsson peeshshana” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hawaareti odida oday asa ubbaa ufayssis. Hessa gisho, ammanoynne Geeshsha Ayyaani kumida Isxifaanose, Filiphphoosa, Phirokoroosa, Niqaarone, Ximoona, Pharmmeenanne Ayhude ammano geli simmida Anxookiya Niqolawoosa dooridosona. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Entta hawaareta sinthan essin, hawaareti entta bolla kushe wothidi Xoossaa woossidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Xoossaa qaalay dalggi dalggi bis. Yerusalaamen de7iya ammaneyssata tayboy dari dari bis; daro kahinetikka ammanidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Isxifaanosey oykettis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Isxifaanosey aadho keehatethaaninne wolqqan kumidi asaa giddon oorathabatanne malaatata oothees. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Aylletethafe keyida Ayhude Woosa Keetha asay Qerenappenne Iskkinddiriyappe Kilqiyafenne Iisiyappe yida issi issi asati denddidi Isxifaanosera palamidosona. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Shin Isxifaanosey Ayyaana wolqqan odettiya cinccatethaa entti eqettanaw dandda7ibookkona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>He wode entti, “Musenne Xoossaa I cayishin si7ida” giya worddo asata shammidosona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessada oothidi biitta cimatanne higge asttamaareta iya bolla denthidosona. Isxifaanose oykkidi Shangguwa sinthe efidosona. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Iya bolla paydida worddo markkati, “Ha uray ha Xoossa Keethanne Muse higgiya zaari zaari cayees. <verse number="14" style="v"/>I, ‘Hayssi Naazirete Yesuusi, ha Xoossa Keethaa laallana; qassi Musey nuus immida higgiya laammana’ yaagishin nuuni si7ida” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shanggo shiiqon uttida asay ubbay Isxifaanose loythidi xeelliya wode iya som77oy kiitanchcho som77o daanees.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Isxifaanose haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kahineta halaqay Isxifaanosekko, “Hayssi tumee?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Isxifaanosey, “Ta ishato, ta aawato, si7ite! Nu aawa Abrahamey Kaaranen daanaw baanappe sinthe Masephexoomiyan de7ishin, bonchcho Xoossay iyaw qonccidi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Medhe 12:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>‘Ne biittaafenne ne dabbotappe shaakettada taani nena bessiya biittaa ba’ yaagis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>He wode Abrahamey Kalddaweta biittaafe keyidi Kaaranen daanaw bis. Iya aaway hayqqidaappe guye Xoossay iya ha biittaa ha77i hintte de7iya bessaa ehis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Medhe 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 12:4">12:4</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>I ha biittaafe hari attoshin tohoy yedhdhiya bessika Abrahames immibeenna. Shin na7i iyaw baynna wode Xoossay ha biittaa iyawunne iya sheeshaas laata oothidi immanayssa qaala gelis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Medhe 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:15">13:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:18">15:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:8">17:8</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Xoossay Abrahamekko, ‘Ne sheeshay hara biittan imathatethan daana; yan oyddu xeetu laythi entti aylletethan haarettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13-14">Medhe 15:13-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Shin taani ne sheeshaa haariya deriya bolla pirddana. Hessafe guye, entti he biittaafe keyidi hayssan taw goynnana’ yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:12">Kessa 3:12</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Xoossay Abrahaame sheeshay qaxxarettana mela iyara caaqqin, Yisaaqi yelettida hosppuntha gallasan qaxxaris. Yisaaqi Yayqooba qaxxaris; qassi Yayqoobi tammanne nam77u ba nayta, nu aawata mayzata qaxxaris.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-14">Medhe 17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2-4">21:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 25:26">25:26</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 29:31-35">29:31-35</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Yayqooba nayti Yoosefa qanaattidi Gibxe biittan aylletethas bayzidosona, shin Xoossay iyara de7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:11">Medhe 37:11</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 37:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 39:2">39:2</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 39:21">21</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v"/>Iya, iya waaye ubbaafe kessis. Gibxe kawuwa sinthan sabanne cinccatethi iyaw immis. Gibxe kawoy Yoosefas Gibxe biittaanne ba keetha ubbaa aysanaada halaqatethi immis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:39-41">Medhe 41:39-41</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Gibxe biittaninne Kanaane biittan ubban koshi gelidi daro asaa un77ethis. He wode nu mayzati kathi demmanaw dandda7ibookkona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:1-2">Medhe 42:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yayqoobi Gibxe biittan kathi de7eyssa si7idi nu aawata koyro yaa yeddis. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nam77antho buussan Yoosefi ba ishatas banatethaa erisis. Gibxe kawoykka Yoosefa sheeshaa eris.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:1">Medhe 45:1</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 45:16">16</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yoosefi ba aawa Yayqoobanne ba dabbo ubbaa, laappun tammanne ichchashu asaa baakko yaana mela kiittidi ehisis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:9-10">Medhe 45:9-10</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 45:17-18">17-18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 46:27">46:27</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yayqoobi Gibxe biittaa wodhdhis; inne iya nayti yan hayqqidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:1-7">Medhe 46:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:33">49:33</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v"/>Entta ahay he bessaafe Seekeme giya biittaa tookettidi bidi, yan Abrahamey Hamoore naytappe daro biran shammida duufon moogettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Medhe 23:3-16</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 33:19">33:19</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:7-13">50:7-13</ref>; Iyu 24:32</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Shin Xoossay Abrahames immana gidayssa poliya wodey gakkanaw matida wode Gibxe biittan de7iya nu asay dari dari bis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7-8">Kessa 1:7-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yoosefa eronna hara kawoy Gibxe biittan kawotis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>He kawoy nu zerethaa genidi guutha nayti hayqqana mela entta kare kessi yeggana mela nu aawata un77ethis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:10-11">Kessa 1:10-11</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 1:22">22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“He wode Musey yelettis; I Xoossaa sinthan daro lo77o na7a. Ba aawa keethan heedzu ageena gakkanaw diccis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Kessa 2:2</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v"/>Musey wora holettida wode Gibxe kawuwa na7iya demma ekkada ba na7a oothada iya dichchasu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:3-10">Kessa 2:3-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v"/>Musey Gibxeta cinccatetha ubbaa tamaaridi odaninne ooson mino asi gidis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Muses laythay oytama kumida wode ba ishata, Isra7eeleta be7anaw ba wozanan qoppis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:11-15">Kessa 2:11-15</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v"/>Isra7eelatappe issuwa Gibxe issoy qohishin be7idi he Isra7eele uraa maaddidi, he qohida Gibxe uraa wodhidi kushe zaaris. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Musey ba ishata ba baggara Xoossay ashshanaw haneyssa entti akeekana gidi qoppis, shin entti akeekibookkona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Wonttetha gallas nam77u Isra7eele asati issoy issuwara wadhettishin demmidi entta sigethanaw koyidi, ‘Asato, hintte ishantta; ays issoy issuwa qohetii?’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Shin ba laggiya qoheyssi Musekko, ‘Nena nu bolla haareyssanne daynna oothiday oonee? <verse number="28" style="v"/>Neeni zine Gibxe uraa wodhidayssada tana wodhanaw koyay?’ yaagidi Muse sugi yeddis. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Musey hessa si7ida wode Gibxefe betidi Miidiyaame biittan bete asi gididi de7ishe nam77u adde nayta yelis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:3-4">Kessa 18:3-4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Godaa kiitanchchoy oytamu laythafe guye, Siina Deriya matan de7iya bazzo tushiya giddon eexiya tama laco giddon Muses benttis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:30-34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:1-10">Kessa 3:1-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v"/>Musey ba be7idayssan malaalettidi, loythi be7anaw tushiya mati shiiqidi de7ishin, Godaa qaalay, <verse number="32" style="v"/>‘Taani ne aawata, Abrahame Xoossaa, Yisaaqa Xoossaa, Yayqooba Xoossaa’ yaagishe Musekko yis. Musey yashshan kokkoridi xeellanaw dandda7ibeenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Goday Musekko, ‘Neeni eqqida biittay geeshshi gidiya gisho ne tohuwan de7iya caammaa kessa. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Taani Gibxen de7iya ta asaa un77etethaa be7as. Entta waasuwa si7ada entta ashshanaw wodhdhas. Ha77i haaya! Taani nena Gibxe kiittana’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Isra7eeleti Muse, ‘Nena nuna haareyssanne daynna oothiday oonee?’ yaagidi ixxidayssa tushiya giddon iyaw benttida kiitanchchuwa baggara haareyssanne ashsheyssa oothidi Xoossay kiittis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Kessa 2:14</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v"/>He Musey Isra7eeleta Gibxefe kessidi malaalisiyabatanne oorathabata Gibxe biittaninne Zo7o Abban oothidi entta oytamu laythi bazzo biittan kaalethis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:5">Kessa 7:5</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:21">14:21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:33">Tay 14:33</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Isra7eele asaakko, ‘Xoossay tana denthidayssada hintte sheeshaa giddofe ta mela nabe hinttew denthana’ yaagiday he Muse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Zaare 18:15</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v"/>Bazzo biittan shiiqida Isra7eele asaara de7idayssi, nu aawataranne Siina Deriya bolla iyaw odida kiitanchchuwara de7ida Musey iya. Yaatidi, Xoossaa de7o qaala nuus immanaw ekkis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:1-20:17">Kessa 19:1-20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:1-33">Zaare 5:1-33</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>“Shin nu mayzati Muses kiitettanaw dosibookkona; iya ixxidi guye Gibxe simmanaw amottidosona. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Qassi Aaronakko, ‘Nuna kaalethiya xoossata nuus ootha. Ays giikko, hayssi nuna Gibxefe ehida Musey, waanidaakko nuuni erokko’ yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Kessa 32:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="41" style="v"/>He wode mari daanisidi eeqa oothidosona. He eeqaas yarshsho yarshshidi bantta kushen oothida oosuwan ufayttidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:2-6">Kessa 32:2-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="42" style="v"/>Shin Xoossay enttaw zokko zaaris. Entti saluwa xoolinttotas goynnana mela entta yeggi aggis. Nabeta maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Isra7eele asato oytamu laythi kumethi</para>
  <para style="q2">bazzo biittan shukkida mehiyanne</para>
  <para style="q2">yarshshida yarshshuwa taw yarshshidetii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42-43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amo 5:25-27</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Hinttee, hinttew goynnanaw kessida eeqaanne Molooke dunkkaaniya</para>
  <para style="q2">Refaana giya hintte xoossaa xoolintto misiliya tookkideta.</para>
  <para style="q">Taani hinttena Babilooneppe</para>
  <para style="q2">hini bagga yeddana’ geetettidi xaafettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Nu aawatas bazzo biittan markka dunkkaaney de7ees. Iyakka Xoossay Muse kiittidayssadanne iya bessidayssada oothis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:9">Kessa 25:9</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 25:40">40</ref></char></note> <verse number="45" style="v"/>Qassi nu aawati he dunkkaaniya bantta aawatappe ekkidi Xoossay kase yedethida Ayhude gidonna asaa biittaa oykkida wode Iyaasura yaa ekkidi gelidosona. He dunkkaaney Dawite wode gakkanawukka he bessan de7is.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Iya 3:14-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="46" style="v"/>Dawitey Xoossan sabettis. Qassi Yayqooba Goday de7ana keethaa keexanaw Xoossaa woossis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2Saamu 7:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-14">1Taari 17:1-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="47" style="v"/>Shin iyaw keethaa keexiday Solomone.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1Kawo 6:1-38</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:1-17">2Taari 3:1-17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>“Hanoshin, Ubbaafe Bolla Xoossay asi keexida keethan deenna. Nabey gidayssa mela,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>‘Saloy ta araata,</para>
  <para style="q2">sa7aykka ta tohoy yedhdhiyaso.</para>
  <para style="q1">Yaatin, taw hintte ay mela keethi keexanee?</para>
  <para style="q2">Woykko taani shemppiyasoy awunee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1-2">Isa 66:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ha ubbaa ta kushiyan oothabiikkinaa?’ yaagees Goday.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>“Hintte waanida si7onna asee? Hintte wozanay Xoossaa qaala ekkanaw ays ixxide? Hintte haythay ays tullidee? Hinttee, hintte aawatatho ubba wode Geeshsha Ayyaanaara eqetteeta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:10">Isa 63:10</ref></char></note> <verse number="52" style="v"/>Nabeta giddofe hintte aawati gooddonnay oonee? Xoossaa Na7ay, Xilloy yaanayssa kasetidi odidayssata wodhidosona. Ha77i hintte iya aathi immidi wodhideta. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Hintte kiitanchchuwa kusheppe Xoossaa higgiya ekkideta, shin kiitettibeekketa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Isxifaanosey shuchchan cadettis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Entti hessa si7ida wode bantta wozanan Isxifaanose bolla daro yilottidi, bantta mettershshaa saxxidi manddidosona. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Shin Isxifaanosey Geeshsha Ayyaanan kumidi, salo pude xeellidi, Xoossaa bonchchuwanne Yesuusa Xoossaa ushachcha baggan eqqidayssa be7is. <verse number="56" style="v"/>“Hekko, taani saloy dooyettin, Asa Na7ay, Xoossaa ushachcha baggan eqqidayssa be7ays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Qaalaa dhoqqu oothidi waassishe, bantta haythaa oykkidi issife iyaakko woxxidosona <verse number="58" style="v"/>Katamaappe gaxa iya kessidi, shuchchan caddidosona. Markkati bantta ma7uwa issi Saa7ola giya na7atethaa matan wothidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Isxifaanosey, “Ta Godaa Yesuusaa, ta shemppuwa ekka” yaagidi xeegishin entti iya shuchchan caddoosona. <verse number="60" style="v"/>Gulbbatidi, ba qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Ta Godaw, ha nagaraa enttaw atto ga” yaagis. Hessa yaagidi simmida mela hayqqi aggis.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Saa7oli ammaniyaa asaa goodis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Saa7oli Isxifaanose hayquwan ufayttis. He gallas Yerusalaamen de7iya woosa keethan gita goodi denddis. Hawaareti attin ammaneyssati ubbay Yihuda biittaninne Samaare biittan laalettidosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Issi issi Xoossaa asati Isxifaanose moogidosona; qassi iyaw daro yeekkidosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Shin Saa7oli woosa keethaa dhayssanaw koyees. Soo soo yuuyi gelidi, ammaniyaa addetanne maccasata goochchi goochchi kessidi qasho keethi gelssees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">Ha@O 22:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Wonggelay Samaaren sabbakettis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Laalettida ammaneyssati bida bessa ubban qaala odidosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Filiphphoosi Samaare katamaa bidi Kiristtoosabaa asaas odis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Daro asay Filiphphoosi gidayssa si7ida wodenne I oothiya malaatata be7ida wode iya akeekidi si7idosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Tuna ayyaanati waassidi daro asaappe keyidosona; qassi daro gunddatinne wobbeti bilettidosona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>He kataman de7iya asay daro ufayttidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Shin Simoona giya issi uray he kataman de7ees. I, ‘Bana gita’ gidi Samaare asaa marotethan malaalisishe gam77is. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Guuthafe gita gakkanaw de7iya asay ubbay, “Gita Xoossaa wolqqay hayssa” gidi iyabaa si77oosona. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Daro wodeppe doomidi marotishe Samaare asaa malaalisida gisho asay iyabaa si7oosona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Shin Filiphphoosi Xoossaa kawotethaabaanne Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthabaa addetasinne maccatas odin, entti iyabaa ammanidi xammaqettidosona. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Qassi Simoonikka ba huu7en ammanidi xammaqettis. Filiphphoosara issife bida bessa ubban oosettiya gita malaatata be7idi malaalettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yerusalaamen de7iya hawaareti Samaare asay Xoossaa qaala ekkidayssa si7ida wode Phexiroosanne Yohaannisa enttako yeddidosona. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Phexiroosinne Yohaannisi bidi, ammaneyssati Geeshsha Ayyaana ekkana mela enttaw Xoossaa woossidosona. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ays giikko, Samaare asati Godaa Yesuusa sunthaa xalaalan xammaqettidosonappe attin enttafe issuwa bollaka Geeshsha Ayyaanay wodhdhibeenna. <verse number="17" style="v"/>He wode Phexiroosinne Yohaannisi bantta kushiya entta bolla wothin, entti Geeshsha Ayyaana ekkidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hawaareti bantta kushiya entta bolla wothin, enttaw Geeshsha Ayyaanay imettidayssa Simooni be7ida wode Phexiroosasinne Yohaannisas miishe ehidi, <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Taanikka ta kushiya wothiya ubbay Geeshsha Ayyaana ekkana mela ha maata tawukka immerkketi” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosi iyaakko, “Neeni Xoossaa imotaa miishen shammanaw qoppida gisho ne miishey neera dhayo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ne wozanay Xoossaa sinthan suure gidonna gisho new hayssan gishoy woykko qaadi baawa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hiza, ha ne wozanaa iitatethaa gisho nagaraappe simma. Ne wozanan de7iya iita qofaa Xoossay atto gaana mela Xoossaa woossa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Gaasoykka, neeni iita qanaateninne nagara qashuwan de7eyssa taani be7ays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Simooni zaaridi, “Hintte gidayssafe issoykka tana gakkonna mela taw Xoossaa woossite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Phexiroosinne Yohaannisi markkattidaappenne Godaa qaala odidaappe guye Yerusalaame simmidosona. Samaaren de7iya daro gutatan Wonggelaa odidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Filiphphoosi Tophphiya moorinnaa xammaqis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Godaa kiitanchchoy Filiphphoosakko, “Denddada Yerusalaameppe Gaaza efiya bazzo biitta ogiyakko ba. He ogey dugeha baggara de7ees” yaagis. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Filiphphoosi denddidi bis. Hinddeke giya Tophphiya kawees I miishe ubbaa naagiya Tophphiya asi de7ees. Ikka goynnanaw Yerusalaame bis. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Para gaariyan uttidi, Yerusalaameppe ba biittaa simmishe nabiya Isayaasa maxaafaa nabbabees.</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 18 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Geeshsha Ayyaanay Filiphphoosakko, “He gaariyakko bada iya mati shiiqa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yaatin Filiphphoosi woxxi bidi gakkiya wode moorinnay nabiya Isayaasa maxaafappe nabbabishin si7idi, “Ne nabbabeyassi new geli?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Moorinnay, “Taw odi gelssiya asi baynna waanidi gelanee?” yaagis. Baara gaariyan keyidi uttana mela Filiphphoosa woossis. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Moorinnay nabbabiya maxaafaa kifiley, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32-33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Isa 53:7-8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">“I dorssada shukettanaw laagettis;</para>
  <para style="q2">Dorssa maray ba ikisiya meedeyssata sinthan si7i geyssada,</para>
  <para style="q2">ikka ba doona dooyibeena.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>I kawuyis; iyaw xillo pirddi dhays.</para>
  <para style="q2">iya de7oy ha sa7aappe qanxettida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2">iya sheeshaabaa oone odanay?” yaagees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Moorinnay zaaridi Filiphphoosakko, “Nabey odebaa odi? Babaa odiyye woykko hara asabaa odi? Taw odarkkii” yaagis. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Filiphphoosi zaaridi, Xoossaa qaala he bessaafe doomidi, Yesuusabaa odiya Wonggelaa iyaw odis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Entti bishe haathi de7iyaso gakkidosona. Moorinnay, “Haathe hayssa be7a; ta xammaqettonna mela aybi diggii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Filiphphoosi iyaakko, “Neeni ne kumetha wozanaappe ammanikko dandda7aasa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">I zaaridi, “Yesuus Kiristtoosi Xoossaa Na7aa gideyssa taani ammanays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Gaarey eqqana mela moorinnay kiittin, nam77ay wodhdhidi haathan gelidosona; Filiphphoosi iya xammaqis. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Entti haathaafe gaxa keyida wode Godaa ayyaanay Filiphphoosa qopponna ekkis. Nam77antho moorinnay Filiphphoosa be7ibeenna, shin ba ogiya ufayttishe bis. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Filiphphoosi Azaaxonan bana demmis. Qassi Qisaariya yaana gakkanaw katamatan yuuyidi Wonggelaa markkattis.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Saa7oli Kiristtoosa ammanis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Ha@O 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He wode Saa7oli Godaa kaalleyssata wodhanaw manddidi kahine halaqaakko bis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Godaa ogiya kaalliya addetanne maccata demmiko, qachchishe Yerusalaame ehanaw, Damasqqon de7iya Ayhude Woosa Keethatas dabddaabbiya baw xaafanaw iya woossis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>I bidi, Damasqqo katamaa gakkanaw matishin, qopponna saloppe wolqqaama poo7oy iya yuushuwan poo7is. <verse number="4" style="v"/>I sa7an kunddidashin, “Saa7olaa, Saa7olaa, ays tana goodday?” giya qaala si7is.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Saa7oli, “Godaw, neeni oonee?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">“Taani, neeni gooddiya Yesuusa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin Saa7oli kokkorishenne malaalettishe, “Godaw, taani ay oothana mela koyay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Goday iyaakko, “Denddada katamaa gela; neeni oothanaw bessiyabay yan new odettana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Saa7olara ogiya biya asati aykkoka odettonna eqqi attidosona. Qaalaa si7oosona, shin oonakka be7ibookkona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Saa7oli kunddida bessaafe denddidi xeelliya wode iya ayfey demmonna ixxis. Hessa gisho, entti iya kushiya oykkidi kaalethidi Damasqqo gelssidosona. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Heedzu gallas gakkanaw I xeellanaw dandda7ibeenna; aykkoka mibeenna; uyibeenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Damasqqon issi Hananiya giya Yesuusa tamaarey de7ees. Goday qonccethan, “Hananiya” yaagidi xeegis.</para>
  <para style="p">Hananey zaaridi, “Ta Godaw, hayssan de7ays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Goday iyaakko, “Denddada Suure geetettiya ogiya bada, Yihuda son Saa7ola giya terseseppe yida uraa koya; Saa7oli woossees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Qassi Hananiya giya addey gelidi, Saa7oli nam77antho xeellana mela ba kushiya iya bolla wothishin qonccethan be7is” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hananey zaaridi, “Godaw, Yerusalaamen ne geeshsha asaa bolla he uray ay mela iitabaa oothidaakko taani daro asaappe si7as. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Qassi Damasqqon ne sunthaa xeegeyssata ubbaa qachchanaw, kahine halaqati iyaw maata immidosona” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin Goday iyaakko, “Saa7oli Ayhude gidonna asaa sinthan, kawota sinthaninne Isra7eele asaa sinthan, ta sunthaa erisanawunne taw oothanaw doorettida miishe gidiya gisho neeni iyaakko ba. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ays giikko, ta sunthaa gisho, I ay mela waaye ekkanaw bessiyako taani iya bessana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hananey bidi, soo gelidi, ba kushiya Saa7ola bolla wothidi, “Ta ishaa Saa7ola, neeni yaa ogiyan new benttida Yesuusi, neeni xeellana melanne Geeshsha Ayyaanan kumana mela Goday tana kiittis” yaagis. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ellesidi, Saa7ola ayfiyaappe issi poqo melabay wodhdhin, Saa7oli nam77antho xeellis. Qassi denddidi xammaqettis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kathi midi xaalidi, Damasqqon de7iya ammaneyssatara guutha gallas gam77is.</para>
  <para style="s">Saa7oli Damasqqon tamaarssis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ellesidi Saa7oli, “Yesuusi Xoossaa Na7a” yaagidi Damasqqon de7iya Ayhude Woosa Keethatan qaala tamaarssis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessa si7ida ubbay malaalettidi, “Hayssi Yerusalaamen Yesuusa sunthaa xeegeyssata qachcheyssa gidenneyye? Qassi ha yiday entta qachchidi, kahine halaqata sinthe efanaassa gidennee?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin Saa7oli qaala odon minni minni bis. Yesuusi, I Kiristtoosa gideyssa qonccisidi odida gisho Damasqqon de7iya Ayhudeti iyaw zaariyaba dhayidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Daro gallasappe guye Ayhudeti shiiqidi, Saa7ola wodhanaw zorettidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:32-33">2Qoro 11:32-33</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v"/>Shin Ayhudeti bana wodhanaw qoppidayssa Saa7oli si7is. Entti iya wodhanaw qammanne gallas katamaa penggiyan naagoosona. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shin iya tamaareti iya qamma efidi, gimbbe dirssaa maskkotiyara daachchora wodhisidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Saa7oli Yerusalaamen tamaarssis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Saa7oli Yerusalaame gakkida wode ammaneyssatara gayttanaw koyis. Shin I Kiristtoosa ammanidayssi enttaw tuma daanonna ixxin iyaw yayyidosona. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Shin Barnnabaasi Saa7ola hawaaretakko efis. Ogen Goday waanidi qonccidaakkonne haasayisidaakko, qassi Saa7oli Damasqqon Yesuusa sunthan yayyonna waattidi qaala odidaakko enttaw geeshshidi odis. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Saa7oli Yerusalaamen yuuyidi Godaa sunthan yayyonna qaala odishe, hawaaretara issife de7is. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Qassi Saa7oli Girike qaala haasayiya Ayhudetara odettishe palamees. Shin entti iya wodhanaw koyidosona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ammaniya asati hessa si7idi, Saa7ola Qisaariya efidi Terseese yeddidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yihudan, Galiilaninne Samaare ubban de7iya woosa keethati sarotethaan de7idosona. Qassi minnidosona; Godaas yayyishe Geeshsha Ayyaana minthethuwan dari dari bidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phexiroosi Liidaninne Yoophen tamaarssis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Phexiroosi biitta ubbaa yuuyishe Liidan de7iya ammaniyaa asatakko gakkis. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yan hosppun laythi kumethi gunddidi arssan zin77idi de7iya Eeniya giya addiya demmis. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Phexiroosi, “Eeniya, Yesuus Kiristtoosi nena pathana; denddada ne hiixa dentha” yaagis. Ikka ellesidi denddi eqqis. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Liidaninne Saaronan de7iya asay ubbay Eeniya be7idi, Godaakko simmidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yoophe kataman issi Xaabito giya ammaniyaara de7awusu. (Xaabito guussay gen77e guussu) Iya ba de7ida wode ubban lo77obaa oothashenne manqota maaddashe de7asu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>He wode iya harggada hayqqin, asay I ahaa meeccidi, pooqiya bolla kessidi zin77isidosona. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Liidi Yoophes mata. Ammaneyssati Phexiroosi Liidan de7eyssa si7idi, “Hayyana nuukko ellessada ya” yaagiya kiitaa nam77u asata bolla iyaakko kiittidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Phexiroosi denddidi, enttara bis. Yaa gakkin, pooqiya bolla de7iya kifiliya iya gelssidosona. Am77eti Phexiroosa yuushuwan eqqidi yeekkishe Dorqqa enttara paxa de7ashe oothida qamisetanne afilata ubbaa Phexiroosa bessidosona. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Phexiroosi entta ubbaa kare kessidi, gulbbatidi Xoossaa woossis. Qassi ahaako simmidi, “Xaabite, dendda” yaagis. Xaabita ba ayfiyaa dooyada Phexiroosa be7ada, dendda uttasu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Phexiroosi iyo ba kushiyan maaddidi denthi essis. Hessafe guye, ammaneyssatanne am77eta xeegidi, denddidaaro entta sinthe shiishis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ha oday Yoophe katama ubbaa gakkis. Daro asay Godaa ammanidosona. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Phexiroosi Yoophen Simoona giya galbba haasheyssa son daro gallas gam77is.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phexiroosanne Qornneliyoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Qisaariyan, “Xaale ola asata” geetettiya olanchchota giddon issi Qornneliyoosa geetettiya mato halaqay de7ees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Qornneliyoosi ba soo asaara Xoossaa minthi ammaniyaa asinne Xoossas goynniya asi. Ayhude manqotakka daro maaddees, qassi Xoossaa ubba wode woossees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Issi gallas uddufun saate heeran Xoossaa kiitanchchoy iyaakko yidi, “Qornneliyoosaa” gidi xeegishin I qonccethan geeshshidi be7is.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Qornneliyoosi dagammidi kiitanchchuwa tishshi oothi xeellidi, “Godaw, I aybee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Kiitanchchoy zaaridi, “Ne woosaynne manqota ne maaddeyssi Xoossaa sinthan hassayettis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ha77i Yoophe ase kiittada, Phexiroosa giya Simoona ehisa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Phexiroosi abbaa doonan galbba haashiya Simoona son imathatethi siiratis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Qornneliyoosi baw odida kiitanchchoy bin, ba aylletappe nam77atanne Xoossaa goynniya ba mata wotaaddaretappe issuwa xeegidi, <verse number="8" style="v"/>enttaw ubbabaa odidi Yoophe kiittis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wonttetha gallas entti bidi, Yoophe katama matishin usuppun saate heeran Xoossaa woossanaw Phexiroosi pooqe bolla keys. <verse number="10" style="v"/>I koshattidi kathi maanaw koyis, shin kathi kaxishin I qonccethi be7is. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Saloy dooyettin, gita afila daaniyabay oyddu baggara oykettidi wodhdhishin I be7is. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Iyan oyddu tohora de7iya meheti, wora do7ati, ulora gooshettiya medhetethatinne salo kafoti ubbay de7ees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>He wode, “Phexiroosaa, dendda eqqada shukkada ma” giya qaalay iyaakko yis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosi, “Godaw, akkay! Ta tunabaa ubbarakka ma erikke” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Qassi, “Xoossay geeshshidayssa neeni tuna gooppa” giya qaalay nam77antho iyaakko yis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessika, heedzu toho hanidaappe guye he gita afila daaneyssi ellesidi pude salo ekettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Phexiroosi ba be7ida qonccethaa birshshethay, “Ay gidanddeshsha?” gidi ba wozanan qoppishin, Qornneliyoosi kiittida asati Simoona soo oychchi demmidi karen eqqidosona. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bantta qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Phexiroosa geetettiya Simoona giya imathay hayssan de7ii?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Phexiroosi qonccethan be7idabaa qofa bolla de7ishin, Geeshsha Ayyaanay iyaakko, “Hekko, heedzu asati nena koyoosona. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Denddada wodhdha, taani entta kiittida gisho sidhonna enttara ba” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Phexiroosi asatakko wodhdhidi, “Hintte koyey tana; ays yidetii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Entti zaaridi, “Nuna mato halaqay Qornneliyoosi kiittis. I xillo, Xoossaa goynniya asinne Ayhude asa ubban daro bonchchettida asi. Qornneliyoosi, nena ba soo ehisidi qaala neeppe si7ana mela geeshsha kiitanchchoy iyaw odis” yaagidosona. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Phexiroosi asata soo gelssidi mokkis.</para>
  <para style="p">Wonttetha gallas, denddidi enttara bis. Yoophe kataman de7iya ammaneyssatappe issoti issoti iyara issife bidosona. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wonttetha gallas, Qisaariya gakkidosona. Qornneliyoosi ba dabbotanne ba mata laggeta issife xeegi shiishidi, Phexiroosa naagees. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Phexiroosi soo gelana hanishin, Qornneliyoosi iyara gayttidi iya sinthan kunddidi iyaw goynnanaw koyis. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosi, “Dendda, takka ta huu7en ne mela ase” yaagidi iya denthis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Phexiroosi Qornneliyoosara odettishe soo geliya wode daro asay shiiqidayssa demmis. <verse number="28" style="v"/>I asaakko, “Ayhude asi hara derera issifanaw woykko gayttanaw woga gidonnayssa hintte ereeta. Shin taani oonakka tuna woykko geeshshi gidenna goonna mela Xoossay tana bessis. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hintte taakko kiittin ixoy baynna yas. Ha77i tana ays xeegisidaakko taw odite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Qornneliyoosi, “Taani hachchi oyddu gallasappe kase hanoode uddufun saate woosa woossishin, phooliya ma7o ma77ida asi ta sinthan eqqis. <verse number="31" style="v"/>I taakko, ‘Qornneliyoosa, Xoossay ne woosaa si7is, neeni manqota maaddidayssaka hassays. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hiza, ase Yoophe kiittada, Simoon Phexiroosa geyssa xeegisa. Simoon Phexiroosi Simoona giya galbba haashiya uraa son abbaa doonan siiratis’ yaagis. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, taani neekko ellesada kiittas; ne lo77o yadasa. Hiza, Xoossay nena Kiittidaba ubbaa si7anaw ha77i nuuni ubbay hayssan Godaa sinthan de7oos” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Phexiroosa haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kaallidikka, Phexiroosi, “Xoossay asa som77o be7idi ase asappe shaakkenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Zaare 10:17</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v"/>Shin ase ubbaa oona gidikkoka baw yayyeyssanne xillo ooso ootheyssan Xoossay ufaytteyssa taani tuma akeekas. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Xoossay, ubbaa Goda gidida Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara sarotethaa odishe ha Wonggelaa Isra7eele asaas kiittidayssa hintte ereeta. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yohaannisi xinqqatebaa Galiilan sabbakida wodiyappe doomidi Yihuda biitta ubbaa gakkanaw hanidabaa hintte ereeta. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Xoossay Naazirete Yesuusas Geeshsha Ayyaananne wolqqaa immis. Xoossay iyara de7iya gisho lo77obaa I oothishe Xalahe kushen haarettida ubbaa pathishe yuuyis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>“Ayhude biittaninne Yerusalaamen I oothida ubbabaas nuuni markkatta. Entti masqaliya bolla kaqqidi iya wodhidosona. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Shin Xoossay heedzantho gallasan hayqoppe iya denthidi asaas qonccana mela oothis. <verse number="41" style="v"/>He qonccethay Xoossay koyro doorida markkatassafe attin asa ubbaas gidenna. I hayqoppe denddidaappe guye iyara midanne uyida. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Xoossay Wonggelaa asaas nuuni odana melanne paxa de7eyssata bollanne hayqqidayssata bolla pirddanaw shuumettiday Yesuusa gideyssa markkattana mela nuna kiittis. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Xoossay iya ammaniyaa ubbaa nagaray, iya sunthan atto geetetteyssa nabeti markkattoosona” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Ayhude gidonna asay Geeshsha Ayyaana ekkidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Phexiroosi buroo he oda onggonnashin qaala si7iya ubbaa bolla Geeshsha Ayyaanay wodhdhis. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Phexiroosara Yoophefe yida ammaniyaa qaxxarettida Ayhude ubbay, Ayhude gidonnayssati bolla Geeshsha Ayyaanay gukkida gisho malaalettidosona. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Gaasoykka, entti dumma dumma doonan haasayishininne Xoossaa gitatethaa sabbishin si7idosona.</para>
  <para style="p">He wode Phexiroosi zaaridi, <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Hayssati qassi nu mela Geeshsha Ayyaana ekkidayssati xammaqettonna mela haathe digganay oonee?” yaagis. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Entti Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthan xammaqettana mela entta kiittis. Hessafe guye, entti banttara guutha gallas uttana mela Phexiroosa woossidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phexiroosi ba oothidabaa Yerusalaame woosa keethaas odis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hawaaretinne Yihuda ubban de7iya ammaneyssati, Ayhude gidonnayssatikka Xoossaa qaala ekkidayssa si7idosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Phexiroosi Yerusalaame bida wode qaxxarettida ammaneyssati, <verse number="3" style="v"/>iyaakko, “Neeni qaxxarettiboonayssatakko gelada enttara kathi ays maaddii?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosi hanidabaa koyroppe doomidi maaran maaran odis: <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Taani Yoophe kataman Xoossaa woossashe qonccethi be7as. Gita afila daaniyabay oyddu baggara oykettidi saloppe wodhdhishe taakko yis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Taani tishshi ootha iya giddo xeelliya wode oyddu tohora de7iya meheta, wora do7ata, ulora gooshettiya medhetethatanne salo kafota be7as. <verse number="7" style="v"/>‘Phexiroosaa, dendda, shukkada ma’ giya qaala taani si7as.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Shin taani, ‘Godaw, akkay, tunabay woykko geeyonnabay ubbaka ta doonaakko shiiqi erenna’ yaagas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“ ‘Xoossay geeshshidayssa neeni tuna gooppa’ yaagiya qaalay nam77antho saloppe yis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Hessi heedzu toho hanin, wurssethan ubbabay salo pude ekettis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>He saatenkka heedzu asati Qisaariyappe taakko kiitettidi taani de7iya keetha gakki aggidosona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Sidhonna enttara bana mela Ayyaanay taw odis. Qassi ha usuppun ishati Yoophefe taara Qisaariya bidayssatara Qornneliyoosa soo gelida. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kiitanchchoy iya son eqqidi iyaakko, ‘Yoophe kiittada Phexiroosa geetettiya Simoona xeegisa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nenanne ne soo asa ubbaa ashshiya qaala I new odana’ gidayssa Qornneliyoos nuus odis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Taani haasaya doomiya wode Geeshsha Ayyaanay koyro nu bolla wodhdhidayssada entta bollaka wodhdhi aggis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>He wode, ‘Yohaannisi haathan xammaqis, shin hintte Geeshsha Ayyaanan xammaqettana’ yaagida Godaa qaalay taw qofettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:5">Ha@O 1:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Xoossay nuus Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammanidayssatas immida imotaa Ayhude gidonnayssataska immiko, yaatin Xoossaa digganaw taani oonee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Entti hessa si7ida wode bantta palamaa aggidi, “Yaatin, Xoossay Ayhude gidonnayssatikka nagaraappe simmidi de7on daanada qaada immis” yaagidi Xoossaa galatidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Anxookiya woosa keethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Isxifaanose hayqos gathida gooda gaason laalettida ammaneyssati qaala Ayhudeta xalaalas odishe Finqqe, Qoophirosanne Anxookiya gakkanaw yuuyidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:1-4">Ha@O 8:1-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Shin Qoophirosappenne Qerenappe yida issi issi ammaniyaa asati Anxookiya bidi, Godaa Yesuusa Wonggelaa Girike asaaskka odidosona. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Godaa wolqqay enttara de7ees; qassi daro asay ammanidi Godaakko simmidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>He odaa Yerusalaamen de7iya woosa keethay si7ida gisho Barnnabaasa Anxookiya kiittis. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Barnnabaasi Anxookiya bida wode Xoossaa aadho keehatethaa oosuwa be7idi ufayttis. Entti ubbay bantta kumetha wozanan Godan minnidi daana mela entta zoris. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Barnnabaasi Geeshsha Ayyaanaynne ammanoy kumida lo77o asi gidiya gisho daro asay Godaa ammanidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Barnnabaasi Saa7ola koyanaw Terseese bis. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yan Saa7ola demmida wode Anxookiya ekkidi yis. Barnnabaasinne Saa7oli woosa keetha asaara laythi kumethi uttidi daro asaa tamaarssidosona. Ammaneyssati Anxookiyan “Kiristtaane” geetettidi koyro xeegettidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>He wode issi issi nabeti Yerusalaameppe Anxookiya wodhdhidosona. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Entta giddofe Agaboosa geyssi denddidi biitta ubban gita koshi keyanayssa Ayyaana wolqqan tinbbite odis. Hessi haniday Roome Kawuwa Qalawudiyoosa wodena.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:10">Ha@O 21:10</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ammaneyssati huu7en huu7en bantta wolqqaa mela miishe kessidi Yihudan de7iya ammaneyssatas maade yeddanaw qofa qachchidosona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Entti hessada oothidi, miishiya Barnnabaasa bollanne Saa7ola bolla woosa keethaa cimatas yeddidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Woosa keetha bolla wolqqaama goodi gakkis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He wode Kawoy Heroodisi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kawoy Heroodisi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hayssi kawoy Heroodisi, Heroodisa Agriphpha giya koyruwa. I, 37-44 Maarotetha Laythaa gakkanaw haaris. I kawuwa Heroodisas na7a na7a</char></note> woosa keetha asaappe baggaa gooda doomis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yohaannisa ishaa Yayqooba mashshan wodhisis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hessi Ayhudeta ufayssidayssa be7idi, gujjidi Phexiroosakka oythis. Hessi haniday Faasika Baale bonchchiya gallasatana. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Phexiroosa oykkidi qachchis. Faasika bonchchiya gallasatappe guye deriya sinthe aathanaw qoppidi, oyddu oyddu wotaaddareti iya naagana mela tammanne usuppun wotaaddaretas aathi immis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kessa 12:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Phexiroosi qasho keethan naagettees. Shin woosa keetha asay iyaw minthidi Xoossaa woossosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Kiitanchchoy Phexiroosa qasho keethafe kessis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Heroodisi Phexiroosa asaa sinthe shiishanaappe kase qamma Phexiroosi nam77u baggara nam77u wotaaddaretara santhalaatan qashettidi entta giddon dhiskkis. Naageyssati qasho keethaa penggetan eqqidi naagoosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Akeekonna de7ishin Godaa kiitanchchoy qonccidis. Qasho keethan poo7oy poo7is. Kiitanchchoy Phexiroosa miyiya bochchi barkkisidi, “Elle dendda” yaagis. Iirakka santhalaatay iya kushiyappe wodhdhi aggis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kiitanchchoy iyaakko, “Ne ma7uwa ma77a, ne caammaaka aatha” yaagis. Phexiroosi hessada oothis; kiitanchchoy, “Ne laxana ma77ada tana kaalla” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Phexiroosi qasho keethafe keyidi kiitanchchuwa kaallis. Iyaw qonccethi be7iyabaa daanisippe attin kiitanchchoy oothiyabay tuma daanibeenna. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kiitanchchoynne Phexiroosi koyruwanne nam77antho wotaaddariya aadhdhidi katamaa efiya biraata penggiyako gakkidosona. Penggey enttaw barkka dooyetti aggis. Entti keyidi issi ogiyara bishin kiitanchchoy akeekonna Phexiroosappe shaaketti aggis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Phexiroosas wozani simmin, “Tana Goday ba kiitanchchuwa kiittidi, Heroodisa kusheppenne naagidi uttida Ayhude asa ubbaafe ashshidayssa ha77i tuma eras” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>I hessa akeekida wode daro asay issife shiiqidi Xoossaa woossiya bessaa, Marqqoosa giya Yohaannisa aaye Mayraami soo bis. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yan karen eqqidi xeegis. Issi Rooda giya oosanchchiya penggiya dooyanaw yasu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Rooda Phexiroosa qaala gididayssa erida wode ufayssan kumada kariya dooyenna guye woxxa bada, “Phexiroosi karen eqqis” yaagada asaas odasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Asay iikko, “Neeni gooyay!” yaagidosona. Rooda Phexiroosa gididayssa geeshshada odasu. Entti, “Hessi iya naagiya kiitanchchuwa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosi karen eqqidi xeegidi aggonna ixxin asay kariya dooyidi iya be7idi malaalettidosona. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Shin entti si7i gaana mela Phexiroosi ba kushiyan mallidi Goday qasho keethafe iya waati kessidaakko enttaw qonccisi odidi, “Hayssa Yayqoobasinne ammaniyaa asatas odite” gidi yaappe keyidi harasoo bis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Sa7ay wonttiya wode, “Phexiroosi aw bide” gidi wotaaddareti woli giddon daro kaccidosona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Heroodisi Phexiroosa koyisin, I dhayida wode naageyssata qoridi, entta wodhana mela kiittis. Hessafe guye, Heroodisi Yihudappe Qisaariya wodhdhidi yan guutha wode uttis.</para>
  <para style="s">Heroodisa hayquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Heroodisi Xiiroosa asa bollanne Sidoona asaa bolla daro hanqettis. Entta biittay kathi Heroodisa biittaafe demmiya gisho entti issife gididi iya moorinnaa Bilasxoosa banttaw cima oothidi giiganaw Heroodisakko bidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Heroodisi sunthida gallasan ba kawotethaa afilaa ma7idi, araata bolla uttidi asaas odis. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Asay, “Hessi Xoossaa qaala, asa qaala gidenna” yaagidi waassidosona. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Heroodisi Xoossaa bonchchiboona gisho iirakka Godaa kiitanchchoy iya dechchin guxunen meetettidi hayqqis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Shin Xoossaa qaalay diccishenne dalggishe bees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Barnnabaasinne Saa7oli bantta oosuwa polidi Marqqoosa giya Yohaannisa banttara ekkidi Yerusalaameppe simmidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Barnnabaasinne Saa7oli kiitettidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Anxookiyan de7iya woosa keethan nabetinne asttamaareti de7oosona. Entti Barnnabaasa, Kareethi geetettiya Simoona, Qerenappe yida Luukiyosa, Kawuwa Heroodisara diccida Minaahenne Saa7ola. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Entti Godaa goynnishininne xoomishin Geeshsha Ayyaanay, “Taani xeegida oosuwas Barnnabaasanne Saa7ola taw dummayite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, entti xoomidaappenne woossidaappe guye bantta kushiya entta bolla wothidi yeddidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Barnnabaasinne Saa7oli Qoophirosa bidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Geeshsha Ayyaanay entta kiittis. Selewuqe bidosona; yaappe markkaben gelidi Qoophirosa haathan teqettida biitta bidosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Entti Silmmaana gakkidi Ayhude Woosa Keethatan Xoossaa qaala odidosona. Yohaannisi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yohaannisi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha bessan xaafettida Yohaannisi, hawaariya Yohaannisa gidonnashin Yohaannis Marqqoosa geetettiya Marqqoosa Wonggelaa xaafidayssa.</char></note> maaddishe enttara de7ees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Entti Qoophirosa haathan teqettida biittaa kanthidi Phaafu gakkiya wode issi worddanchcho nabiya Bar-Yesuusa giya Ayhude maruwa demmidosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>He maroy deriya aysiya Sarggiyoos Phawuloosa giya akeekanchcho addiyara de7ees. Sarggiyoos Phawuloosi Barnnabaasanne Saa7ola baakko xeegidi Xoossaa qaala si7anaw koyis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shin Girike doonan maruwa sunthay “Elimaasa” geetettees. I deriya haareyssi ammanonna mela digganaw koyidi Barnnabaasaranne Phawuloosara eqettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosa giya Saa7oli Geeshsha Ayyaanan kumidi maruwa caddi xeellidi, <verse number="10" style="v"/>“La, Xalahe na7aw, iitatethi ubbay kumidaysso, xillotetha ubbaas morkkiyaw, suure Godaa ogiya mirqeyssa aggikii? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hekko, ha77i Godaa kushey ne bolla de7ees. Neeni qooqe gidana; guutha wodes awa poo7o be7akka” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Iira caaganaynne dhumay iya ayfiyaa goozin, ba kushiya oykkidi kaalethiya asi koyishe yuuyis. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Deriya ayseyssi hessa be7ida wode Godaaba tamaarsseysan malaalettidi ammanis.</para>
  <para style="s">Barnnabaasinne Phawuloosi Phisidiya Anxookiya bidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Phawuloosinne iyara de7eyssati Phaafuppe denddidi, Phinfiliyan de7iya Phergge markkabera bidosona. Yohaannisi enttafe shaakettidi Yerusalaame simmis. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin entti Pherggefe aadhdhidi Phisidiyan de7iya Anxookiya gakkidosona. Sambbaata gallas Ayhude Woosa Keethi gelidi uttidosona. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Muse higgeynne nabeta maxaafay nabbabettidaappe guye Ayhude Woosa Keetha halaqati, “Nu ishato, asaa minthethiya qaali hinttew de7iyakko asaas oderkketii” yaagidi enttako kiittidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Phawuloosi denddi eqqidi ba kushe mallidi, “Isra7eele asatonne, Xoossaa goynniya Ayhude gidonna asaw, si7ite. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ha Isra7eele asaa Xoossay nu mayzata dooris. Gibxe biittan imathatethan entti de7ishin, entta darssidi ba gita wolqqan Gibxe biittaafe entta kessis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Kessa 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:51">Kessa 12:51</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bazzo biittan oytamu laytha mela entta dandda7is.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:34">Tay 14:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:31">Zaare 1:31</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kanaane giya biittan Ayhude gidonna laappun kawotethata diggidi entta biittaa ba asaa laatisis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:1">Zaare 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 14:1">Iya 14:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, nabiya Saamu7eela wode gakkanaw oyddu xeetanne ishatamu laytha mela aysiya daynnata enttaw immis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:16">Zaare 2:16</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:20">1Saamu 3:20</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, entti banttaw kawo immana mela woossin, Xoossay Biniyame sheeshaappe Qiise na7aa, Saa7ola oytamu laythi kawotana mela enttaw immis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">1Saamu 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:21">10:21</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v"/>Xoossay Saa7ola shaaridaappe guye entta bolla Dawite kawothis. Xoossay Dawitebaa markkattishe, ‘Taani koyaa ubbaa ta wozanaa mela oothiya Isseyye na7aa Dawite demmas’ yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">1Saamu 13:14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:12">16:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:20">Maz 89:20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Xoossay, ‘Taani Dawite sheeshaappe Isra7eele deriya ashsheyssa ehana’ gidayssa mela Yesuusa ehis. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesuusi yaanappe sinthe Isra7eele asay ubbay bantta nagaraappe simmidi xammaqettana mela Yohaannisi qaala odis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3">Luuqa 3:3</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v"/>Qassi Yohaannisi ba oosuwa wurssana hanishe asaakko, ‘Tana oona gidi qoppeetii? Taani hintte naagiya Kiristtoosa gidikke, shin taani iya caammaa birshshanaw taw bessonnayssi taappe guyera yees’ yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Maato 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7">Mar 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luuqa 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yoha 1:20</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:27">27</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Ishato, Abrahaame sheeshatoo, qassi hayssan Ayhude gidonnashin Xoossas yayyeyssato, ha atotethaa qaalay nuus kiitettis. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ays giikko, Yerusalaamen de7iya asaynne entta halaqati Yesuusa eribookkona. Sambbaata ubban nabbabettiya nabeta qaala akeekiboonna gisho iya bolla pirddidi nabeti odida qaala polidosona. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesuusa wodhisanaw issi gaasoykka enttaw dhayin Philaaxoosi iya wodhana mela woossidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:22-23">Maato 27:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:13-14">Mar 15:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:21-23">Luuqa 23:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:15">Yoha 19:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v"/>Entti Yesuusabay Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettidaba ubbaa polida wode masqaliyappe iya wodhisidi moogidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Maato 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luuqa 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoha 19:38-42</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v"/>Shin Xoossay hayqoppe Yesuusa denthis. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, I baara Galiilappe Yerusalaame yidayssatas daro toho benttis. Entti ha77i iyabaa asaas markkattoosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Ha@O 1:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Xoossay nu aawatas immana gida Wonggelaa nuuni hinttew odoos. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Dawitey ba Mazmure Maxaafan nam77antho shemppuwan,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Neeni, ta Na7a,</para>
  <para style="q2">taani hachchi nena yelas’</para>
  <para style="m">geetettidi xaafettidayssa Yesuusa, Xoossay hayqoppe denthidi nu mayzatas immana gidayssa nuus entta naytas polis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz 2:7</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v"/>I wooqonna mela Xoossay hayqoppe iya denthon erisanaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Taani Dawites immana gida</para>
  <para style="q2">ammanettida geeshsha anjjuwaa hinttew immana’ yaagidi odis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">Isa 55:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Mazmure Maxaafan harason qassi,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Ne Geeshsha Na7aa ahaa wooqisakka’ yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Maz 16:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Dawitey ba wode Xoossaa qofaa polidaappe guye hayqqidi ba aawatara moogettidi wooqis. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Shin Xoossay hayqoppe denthidayssi wooqibeenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, ta ishato, nagara atotethay Yesuusa baggara kasetidi hinttew odettidayssa erite. Muse higgey nagaraappe xillisanaw dandda7enna. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusa ammaniyaa ubbay nagaraappe xillees. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, nabeti gidayssi hintte bolla gakkonna mela naagettite.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>‘Xoossay gidabaa leeqiseyssato! Be7ite! Malaalettite! Dhayite!</para>
  <para style="q2">oonikka odin, hintte ammanonna oosuwa</para>
  <para style="q2">taani hintte wodiyan oothana’ yaagidosona” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 1:5">Ib 1:5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Phawuloosinne Barnnabaasi Ayhude Woosa keethafe keyishin, kaalliya Sambbaatan hessa gujjidi odana mela asay enttana woossidosona. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Shiiqoy laalettidayssafe guye daro Ayhudetinne Ayhudeta ammanuwan gelidi Xoossaa yayyiya daroti Phawuloosanne Barnnabaasa kaallidosona. Ammanidayssati Xoossaa aadho keehatethan minnidi daana mela entta zoridosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kaalliya Sambbaatan kataman de7iya asaappe daroti Xoossaa qaala si7anaw shiiqidosona. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Shin Ayhudeti daro asaa be7ida wode Phawuloosa qanaattidi iya haasaya ixxidi iya cayidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Phawuloosinne Barnnabaasi yayyonna, “Xoossaa qaalay koyrottidi hinttew odettanaw koshshees. Shin hintte qaala ixxidi merinaa de7uwa ekkanaw nuus bessenna gidi hinttee, hintte huu7en pirddida gisho hiza nuuni Ayhude gidonnayssatakko simmos. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Gaasoykka Goday,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Alame kumethay ne baggara attana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2">taani nena Ayhude gidonna deriyas poo7o oothas’ yaagidi nuna kiittis” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ayhude gidonnayssati hessa si7ida wode ufayttidi Xoossaa qaala bonchchidosona. Qassi merinaa de7uwas doorettida ubbay ammanidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Godaa qaalay he biitta ubbaa gakkis. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Shin Ayhudeti, Ayhude gidonna Xoosse goynniya dure maccasatanne kataman de7iya gita asata Phawuloosa bollanne Barnnabaasa bolla denthethidosona. He asati entta gooda doomidi bantta biittaafe kessidosona. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosaranne Barnnabaasara ixxeyssatas malla gidana mela bantta tohuwappe baana pittidi Iqooniyone katama bidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Maato 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:11">Mar 6:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:5">Luuqa 9:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:11">10:11</ref></char></note> <verse number="52" style="v"/>Qassi Anxookiyan de7iya ammaneyssati Geeshsha Ayyaananinne ufayssan kumidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosinne Barnnabaasi Iqooniyone bidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kaseyssadakka, Phawuloosinne Barnnabaasi Iqooniyonen Ayhudeta woosa keethi gelidi daro Ayhudetinne Ayhude gidonnayssati ammanana gakkanaw qaala odidosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Shin ammaniboonna Ayhudeti, Ayhude gidonnayssata wozanaa laammidi ishata bolla denthethidosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hawaareti yan daro wodiya gam77idosona. Entti yayyonna Godaabaa odidosona. Goday malaatatanne oorathabaa entti oothana mela enttaw maata immidi ba aadho keehatethaa qaalay tuma gideyssa qonccisis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Shin he katamaa asay shaakettidi, baggay Ayhudetara baggay qassi Hawaaretara gidis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ayhude gidonnayssatinne Ayhudeti bantta halaqatara issife gididi hawaareta qohanawunne shuchchan caddanaw koyidosona. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hawaareti hessa eridi, Lisxiranne Darbbe giya Liqaa7oniya katamatanne entta heeran de7iya biittaa baqatidosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yan Wonggelaa odidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosinne Barnnabaas Lisxiraninne Darbben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yelettoosappe doomidi nam77u tohoy wobbin hamuti eronna issi addey Lisxiran de7ees. <verse number="9" style="v"/>He addey Phawuloosi odishin uttidi si7ees. Phawuloosi iya tishshi oothi xeelliya wode paxanaw iyaw ammanoy de7eyssa be7idi, <verse number="10" style="v"/>ba qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Sitti gada ne tohuwan eqqa” yaagis. Yaatin, guppi denddi eqqidi hamuthi doomis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Phawuloosi oothidayssa asay be7idi bantta qaala dhoqqu oothidi Liqaa7oniya doonan, “Xoossati ase daanidi nuukko wodhdhidosona” yaagidosona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Barnnabaasa, “Diya” gidi, Phawuloosi haasayan waannatiya gisho iya, “Hermmeesa” gidi sunthidosona. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Katamaappe gaxan de7iya eeqaa Diya keethaa kahineynne asay kormmatanne alleeqo ciishshata hawaaretas yarshshanaw koyidi katamaa pengge ehidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin Barnnabaasinne Phawuloosi hessa si7ida wode entti oothanaw qoppidayssa ixxidi bantta ma7uwa peedhidosona. Asaa giddo woxxi gelidi, <verse number="15" style="v"/>bantta qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Asaw, hayssa ays ootheetii? Nukka hintte mela ase. Ha pathonnabaappe saluwanne sa7aa, abbaanne entta giddon de7iya ubbabaa medhdhida de7o Xoossaakko hintte simmana mela hinttew nuuni Wonggelaa odoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Kessa 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Maz 146:6</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v"/>I beni asaa bantta ogiya baana mela yeddi aggis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Shin iraa saluwappe bukisis, kathaaka wodiyan wodiyan immis, kathi immidi hinttena daro ufayssis, yaatidi hinttew lo77obaa oothidi baw markka dhayssibeenna” yaagidosona. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hawaareti hessa gidi banttaw asay yarshshonna mela waayidi diggidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Anxookiyappenne Iqooniyoneppe yida Ayhudeti, asaa bantta bagga zaaridi shuchchan Phawuloosa caddidosona. Enttaw I hayqqidabaa daanin katamaappe gaxa goochchi efidi yeggidosona. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Shin ammaneysati yidi, iya yuushuwan eqqidashin I denddidi katamaa gelis. Wonttetha gallas Barnnabaasara issife Darbbe bis.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosinne Barnnabaasi Sooriya Anxookiya simmidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Entti Darbbe kataman Wonggelaa odidi darota ammanthidaappe guye Lisxira, Iqooniyonenne Phisdiya Anxookiya simmidosona. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yan ammaneyssata minthethishenne entti ammanon minnidi de7ana mela zorishe, “Xoossaa kawotethaa gelanaw nuuni daro waaye ekkanaw bessees” yaagidi tamaarssidosona. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Qassi woosa keethatas huu7en huu7en cimata dooridosona. Xoomidaappenne woossidaappe guye entti ammanida Godaas entta hadara immidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Phisidiya biittaa kanthidi aadhdhidi Phinfiliya bidosona. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pherggen qaala odidaappe guye Axaaliya bidosona. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Axaaliyappe entti bantta polida oosuwas Xoossaa aadho keehatethaas entta hadara immida Anxookiya markkaben simmidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Anxookiya gakkida wode woosa keethaa asaa shiishidi Xoossay enttara oothida oosuwa ubbaanne Ayhude gidonna asay ammanana mela enttaw waati pengge dooyidaako odidosona. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessan ammaneyssatara daro wode gam77idosona.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yerusalaame shiiquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Issi issi asati Yihudappe Anxookiya bidi, “Muse wogaatho hintte qaxxarettonna ixxiko attanaw dandda7ekketa” gidi ammaneyssata tamaarsso doomidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Leewe 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hessi Phawuloosanne Barnnabaasa enttara daro palamanaadanne kaccanaada oothis. Hessa gisho, Anxookiyan de7iya issi issi asati Phawuloosaranne Barnnabaasara Yerusalaame bidi Hawaaretaranne cimatara gayttidi he odaa billanaw qofay qashettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Woosa keethay entta kiittin bidosona. Entti Finqeranne Samaarera aadhdhishe Ayhude gidonnayssati Xoossako waanidi simmidaakko odidosona. Hessi ammaneyssata ubbaa daro ufayssis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Entti Yerusalaame gakkida wode woosa keethay, Hawaaretinne cimati entta mokkidosona. Xoossay banttara oothidabaa ubbaa odidosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Shin Farisaaweta baggafe ammanida issi issi asati denddi eqqidi, “Ayhude gidonnashin ammanida asati qaxxaretanawunne Muse higgiya naaganaw bessees” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hawaaretinne cimati hessa zorettanaw shiiqidosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Keehi haasayidayssafe guye, Phexiroosi denddi eqqidi, “Ta ishato, Ayhude gidonnayssati Wonggelaa qaala ta doonappe si7idi ammanana mela kasetidi tana Xoossay hintte giddofe dooridayssa hintte ereeta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:1-43">Ha@O 10:1-43</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Asa wozana eriya Xoossay Geeshsha Ayyaana nuus immidayssada enttawuka immidi tumays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Ha@O 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:44">10:44</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ammanon entta wozanaa geeshshida gisho nu giddoninne entta giddon dummatethi wothibeenna. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, nu aawatinne nuuni tookkanaw dandda7iboonna qambbara ammaneyssata morggen wothidi ha77i ays hintte Xoossaa paacetii? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatethan entti attidayssada nukka attidayssa ammanoos” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Asay si7i gidi, Barnnabaasinne Phawuloosi Ayhude gidonna asaa giddon bantta baggara Xoossay oothida malaatatanne oorathabaa ubbaa odishin si7oosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Entti haasaya onggidaappe guye Yayqoobi, “Ishato, ta geyssa si7ite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Xoossay Ayhude gidonnayssata giddofe ba ase dooranaw koyidi enttana koyro waattidi qoppidaakko Simooni odis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nabeta qaalay hayssara ginees. Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>‘Hayssafe guye taani simmana,</para>
  <para style="q2">kunddida Dawite kawotethaa denthana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Amo 9:11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">Laattida keethaka zaara essana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Attida asay ubbay taakko yaana,</para>
  <para style="q2">taani xeegida Ayhude gidonna asay ubbay tana koyana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Benippe doomada hessi erettana mela oothida</para>
  <para style="q2">Xoossay, taani yaagays’ yaages.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, ta qofay Xoossako simmiya Ayhude gidonnayssata nuuni waaysonnaako lo77o. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Shin entti eeqas yarshshettidi tunidabaa moonna mela, laymatonna mela, bawuta moonna melanne suuthi uyonna mela enttaw nuuni dabddaabbiya xaafanaw koshshees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:15-17">Kessa 34:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-16">Leewe 17:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:6-23">18:6-23</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v"/>Muse higgey benippe doomidi Sambbaatan Sambbaatan Ayhude Woosa Keethatan nabbabettishe katama ubban sabbakettees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, hawaaretinne cimati woosa keethaa asa ubbaara issife bantta giddofe guutha asata dooridi Phawuloosaranne Barnnabaasara Anxookiya yeddanaw qofa qachchidosona. Entti daro bonchchettida nam77u asata Barssaaba geetettiya Yihudanne Sillaase dooridosona. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hayssada geetetti xaafettida dabddaabbiya entta bolla yeddidosona: “Nuuni hawaaretinne cimati hintte ishati, Anxookiyan, Sooriyaninne Kilqiyan de7iya Ayhude gidonna ishatas nu sarothuwa kiittoos.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Nuuni kiittonna asati nu giddofe bidi, ‘Hintte qaxxarettanawunne higgiya naaganaw bessees’ gidi, hinttena waaysidayssanne yiloyidayssa si7ida. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nuuni dosiya Barnnabaasanne Phawuloosa doorettida asatara issife hintteko kiittanaw issi wozanan nu qofaa qachchida. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Entti nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa gisho bantta de7uwa aathi immidosona. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, nuuni xaafidayssa entti bantta doonan gujjidi hinttew odana mela Yihudanne Sillaase kiittida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Ha koshsheyssatappe attin hara tooho hinttena toossonna mela nunne Geeshsha Ayyaanay oda qachchida. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Eeqas yarshshettidi tunidabaa mooppite, suuthu uyoppite, bawuta mooppite, laymatoppite. Ha ubbaafe hintte huu7iya naagikko hintte lo77obaa ootheeta. Hiza, saro de7ite” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, kiitettidayssati moyzettidi Anxookiya bidi ammaniyaa asaa shiishidi, dabddaabbiya immidosona. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Entti he minthethiya dabddaabbiya nabbabida wode ufayttidosona. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Qassi Yihudinne Sillaasey bantta huu7en nabe gidiya gisho ammaneyssata loythi zoridi minthethidosona. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Entti Anxookiyan guutha gallas uttidaappe guye ishati lo77ora moyzin banttana kiittidayssatakko simmidosona. <verse number="34" style="v"/><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi maaxafatan paydo 34 baawa.</char></note> [Shin Sillaasey yan attanaw koyis.]</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Qassi Phawuloosinne Barnnabaasi hara daro asatara issife Godaa qaalaa tamaarssishenne Wonggelaa odishe Anxookiyan gam77idosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosinne Barnnabaasi shaakettidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Guutha gallasappe guye Phawuloosi Barnnabaasako, “Nuuni Godaa qaala odida katama ubban nu ammaneysati waanidi de7iyakko guye simmishe xomoosi be7oos” yaagis. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Barnnabaasi Marqqoosa geetettiya Yohaannisa banttara efanaw koyis. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosi Marqqoosa banttara efanaw koyibeenna. Gaasoykka, I Phinfiliyan shaakettidi enttara oothanaw bibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Ha@O 13:13</ref></char></note> <verse number="39" style="v"/>Entta giddon iita ooshshi keyin issoy issuwafe shaakettidosona. Barnnabaasi Marqqoosa ekkidi markkabera Qoophirosa bis. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosi Sillaase dooris; ammaneysati Phawuloosa Xoossaa aadho keehatethaas hadara immidaappe guye i keyidi bis. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yaatidi, woosa keethata minthethishe Sooriyaranne Kilqiyara aadhdhis.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ximotiyoosi Phawuloosaranne Sillaasera gayttis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Phawuloosi Darbbenne Lisxira bis. Yan Ximotiyoosa giya ammaniyaa asi de7ees. Iya aayiya ammaniyaa Ayhude maccas, iya aaway Girike asi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lisxiraninne Iqooniyonen de7iya ammaneysati Ximotiyoosabaa loythidi markkattidosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Phawuloosi Ximotiyoosa baara efanaw koyidi, iya aaway Girike asi gididayssa he bessan de7iya Ayhude ubbay eriya gisho iya qaxxaris. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Entti katamatara bishe Yerusalaamen de7iya hawaaretinne cimati wothida higgiya ammaneyssati naagana mela enttaw odishe aadhdhidosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, woosa keethati ammanon minnishe, taybonkka gallas gallas dari dari bidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Maqedooniya baanada xeegettis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Iisiyan qaala odonna mela Geeshsha Ayyaanay entta diggida gisho, Phirggiyaranne Galaatiya biittaara aadhdhidosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Entti Miisiya zawaa gakkida wode Bitiiniya baanaw koyidosona. Shin Yesuusa Ayyaanay entta diggis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, entti Miisiya matara aadhdhishe Xiro7aada wodhdhidosona. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Phawuloosi qamma qonccethan issi Maqedooniya asi baakko, “Maqedooniya pinnada nuna maaddarkii” yaagishe eqqidi woossishin be7is. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Qonccethaa I be7idaappe guye ellesidi nuuni Maqedooniya baanaw koyida. Ays giikko, Wonggelaa yan de7iya asaas odanaw Xoossay nuna xeegidayssa erida.</para>
  <para style="s">Liidiya Kiristtoosa ammanasu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Xiro7aadappe denddidi markkaben gelidi Samotiraaqe bida, wonttetha gallas Naaphule bida. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessafe denddidi Maqedooniya biittan de7iya Filphisiyuusa giya koyro katama bida. Qassi Filphisiyuusi Roome asay de7iya katama. Nuuni he kataman guutha gallas uttida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Sambbaata gallas katamaappe gaxan Shaafaa doonan Ayhudeti Xoossaa woossiya bessi de7eyssa eridi yaa bida. He bessan shiiqida maccasaas qaala odida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nuna si7iya asappe issi Liidiya geetettiya Tiyatiroona katamaappe yida, Xoossaa ammanida zo7o afila zal77iya, maccasiya de7awusu. Phawuloosi odeyssa iya si7ana mela Xoossay I wozanaa dooyis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Liidiya ba soo asaara issife xammaqettidaappe guye nuukko, “Hintte tana Godaa tuma ammanasu giikko ta soo yedhdhite” gada miinthada woossasu.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosinne Sillaasi qashettidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nuuni Xoossaa woossiya bessaa bishin iita ayyaanay I bolla de7idi kaayisiya issi geela7o aylley nuura gayttasu. Iya kaayada daro miishe ba godatas ehawusu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Phawuloosanne nuna kaallada, “Hayssati Ubbaafe Bolla Xoossaa aylleta! Entti hintte attana ogiya odeyssata” gada waassasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ubba gallas hessada gawusu. Shin Phawuloosi yilotidi guye simmidi, he ayyaanaa, “Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthan neeni iippe keya” gidi kiittis. Iirakka iita ayyaanay iippe keyi aggis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Shin I godati banttaw miishe demmiya ogey dhayidayssa be7idi, Phawuloosanne Sillaase oykkidi, dabaaba daynnata sinthe goochchi efidosona. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Daynnata sinthe entta efidi, “Hayssati Ayhude asi gidishe nu katamaa asaa daro waaysosona. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nuuni Roome biitta asi gidishe ekkanawunne oothanaw woga gidonnabaa tamaarssosona” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Asay issi bagga gididi, Phawuloosa bollanne Sillaase bolla denddidosona. Daynnati entta ma7uwa qaaridi xam77an entta shocana mela kiittidosona. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Entta daro wadhdhidaappe guye, qasho keethi gelssidosona. Qasho keethaa naageysika entta minthi naagana mela kiittidosona. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Qasho keethaa naageyssi he kiitaa ekkidi, Phawuloosanne Sillaase qasho keethas qol77a gelssis. Entta tohuwa duuxis.</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 19 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shin giddi bilahe gidiya wode Phawuloosaranne Sillaasera woossishenne mazmure yexxishe Xoossaa galatoosona. Qasho keethan de7iya hara asatikka entti giyabaa si7oosona. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Qopponna qasho keethaa baasoy qaaxxana gakkanaw biitta qaaxoy hanis. He saatenkka pengge ubbay dooyetti aggis; qashettida asa ubbaa santhalaatay birshsheti wodhdhis. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Qasho keethaa naageyssi dhiskkofe barkida wode qasho keethaa pengge ubbay dooyettidayssa be7idi qasho asay kessi ekki bidabaa daanin bana wodhanaw mashshe ekkis. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosi qaala dhoqqu oothidi “Nu ubbay hayssan de7iya gisho neeni nena qohoppa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Qasho keethaa naageyssi xomppe woossi ekkidi ellesidi gaathi woxxis. Kokkorishe Phawuloosa sinthaninne Sillaase sinthan gufannis. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Entta kare kessidi, “Ta godato, taani attanaw ay oothanaw bessii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Phawuloosaranne Sillaasera iyaakko, “Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammana; neeranne ne soo asaara attana” yaagidosona. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Entti iyasinne iya son de7iya ubbaas Godaa qaala odidosona. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Qamma he saatenkka qasho keethaa naageyssi entta efidi entta madunthaa meeccis. Ellesidi ba soo asa ubbaara xammaqettis. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Phawuloosanne Sillaase ba soo efidi enttaw kathi aathis. I ba soo asa ubbaara Xoossaa ammanida gisho ufayttis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Sa7ay wonttin daynnati, “He asata billa” yaagidi poolise halaqata iyaakko kiittidosona. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Qasho keethaa naageyssi, “Hintte bilettana mela daynnati kiittidosona. Hiza, keyidi saro biite” yaagidi he kiitaa Phawuloosas odis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosi he poolise halaqatakko, “Nuuni Roome asi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Roome asi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Phawuloosi Roome asi yaagidi bana xeegiday he wode Ayhude biittaa haarey Roome kawotethaa gidida gishossa. He wode Roome biittan de7iya asay pirddi baynna garaafettokona.</char></note> gidishin entti nuna pirddi baynna asaa sinthan wadhdhidi, qasho keethan yeggidosona. Ha77i nuna geeman keyidi bo goonaa? Hanenna, entti bantta huu7en yidi nuna kesso” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Poolise halaqati daynnatas hessa odin, Phawuloosaranne Sillaasera Roome biitta ase gididayssa si7ida wode yayyidosona. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, daynnati yidi enttako, “Nuuni hinttena qohida” gidosona. Qasho keethafe kare entta kessidi, katamaappe keyidi baana mela woossidosona. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Phawuloosaranne Sillaasera qasho keethafe keyidi Liidiya soo bidosona. Yan ammaneyssatara gaakettidi entta minthethidi keyidi bidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Teselonqen tamaarssis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Phawuloosaranne Sillaasera Amfiphoolisaranne Apholoniyara aadhdhidi Teselonqe bidosona. Yan Ayhude Woosa Keethi de7ees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Phawuloosi kaseyssada yaa gelis. Hessan heedzu saamintta Xoossaa qaalappe asaas odis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi waaye ekkanawunne hayqoppe denddanaw besseyssa enttaw qonccisidi odishe, “Yesuusi ha taani hinttew odeyssi Kiristtoosa” yaagis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Enttafe issoti issoti oday tuma gideyssa ma77idi Phawuloosaranne Sillaasera issifidosona. Hessadakka, Xoossaa goynniya daro Girike asaynne daro bonchchettida maccasatikka enttara issifidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Shin Ayhudeti qanaattidi issi issi oosoy baynna iita asata ogeppe shiishidosona. Kataman buqethi kessidosona; Phawuloosanne Sillaase asaas aathi immanaw koyidi Yaasona keethaa teqqidosona. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Phawuloosinne Sillaasi enttaw benttonna ixxin, Yaasonanne issi issi ammaneyssata katamaa halaqatakko goochchi efidi, “Hayssati biitta ubbaa buqeyssati ha77i nuukko yidosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yaasoni entta ba son wothis. Hayssati, ‘Yesuusa giya hara kawoy de7ees’ gidi Qeesara kiitaa menthosona” yaagidi dhoqqu gida qaalan odidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shiiqida asaynne katamaa halaqati hessa si7idi hananabaa dhayidosona. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Halaqati Yaasonanne harata waasen birshshidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Beeriyan tamaarssis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ammaneysati Phawuloosanne Sillaase qammara Beeriya yeddidosona. Beeriya gakkidi, Ayhude Woosa Keethi gelidosona. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Beeriya asati Teselonqe asatappe aadhdhida suureta. Entti qaala kumetha wozanaappe ekkidosona; Phawuloosi gidayssi tuma gideyssa shaakki eranaw gallas gallas Geeshsha Gaxaafata xanna7oosona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, enttafe daroti, Giriketappeka bonchchettida daro maccasatinne daro addeti ammanidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin Teselonqen de7iya Ayhudeti Phawuloosi Xoossaa qaala Beeriyankka odidayssa si7ida wode Beeriya yidi asaa buqidosona. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, ammaneyssati ellesidi Phawuloosa abbaa mati yeddidosona. Shin Sillaaseynne Ximotiyoosi Beeriyan attidosona. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Phawuloosa moyzida asati Ateena gathidosona. He asati Sillaaseynne Ximotiyoosi banttaw dandda7ettida mela ellesidi baakko yaana mela Phawuloosi kiittida kiitaa ekkidi Beeriya simmidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Ateena bis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Phawuloosi Ateenan Sillaasenne Ximotiyoosa naagishe, kataman eeqi kumidayssa be7idi yilotis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Ayhude Woosa Keethan Ayhudetaranne Xoossaa goynniya Ayhude gidonna asatara qassi baara gayttiya asatara ubba gallas palamees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Eppiqoroosanne Istoyke geetettiya cugetappe issi issi eranchchoti Phawuloosara palamidosona. Enttafe issoti issoti, “Ha yooyamay ay odanaw koyii?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Harati Phawuloosi Yesuusabaanne hayqoppe I denddidayssa banttaw odida gisho, “Ooratha xoossatabaa odiya daanees” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Phawuloosa oykkidi Aryoospaagosa giya shiiqo bessaa efidi, “Ha neeni tamaarssiya oorathabay aybeekko nuna erisikkii? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ays giikko, neeni nuus oorathabaa odaasa; hiza hessi aybeekko nuuni eranaw koyoos” yaagidosona. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ateena asay ubbaynne hessan de7iya imathati oorathabaa odettonnanne si7onna pee7okkona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Phawuloosi Aryoospaagosa sinthan eqqidi, “Ateena asato, xoossatas ubbaban hintte daro yayyeyssa taani be7ays. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Taani hintte katamaara yuuyashe hintte goynniya bessata be7iya wode, ‘Erettonna Xoossaas’ geetetti xaafettida yarshsho bessaa demmas. Ha hintte eronnashin goynneyssa taani hinttew odays. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Sa7aanne sa7an de7iya ubbabaa medhdhida Xoossay, saluwanne sa7aa Goday, asi keexida keethan deenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:27">1Kawo 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:5">Isa 42:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:48">Ha@O 7:48</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v"/>I de7o, shempponne ubbabaa asa ubbaas immiya gisho paci de7iya asada asa maade koyenna. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Xoossay asa zerethi ubbaa issi addiyafe medhdhidi biitta ubban wothis. Yaatidi entti de7ana wodiyasinne bessaas zawa immis. <verse number="27" style="v"/>I hessa oothiday asi iya koyana melanne pilggidi demmana melassa. Hanikkoka I nuuppe geemmibeenna. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hinttefe issi issi yexxeyssati, ‘Nuuni iya nayta’ gidayssada, ‘Nuuni iyan paxa de7oos, qaaxoos.’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hiza, nuuni Xoossaa nayta gidiya gisho, ‘Xoossay asa hiillatethaninne qofan worqqafe woykko birappe woykko shuchchafe oosettidabaa daanees’ yaagidi qoppanaw bessenna. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossay kase wode asay eronna oothidayssa aggidi aadhdhis, shin ha77i ubbason de7iya asi ubbay nagaraappe simmana mela kiittees. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ays giikko, Xoossay ba doorida addiyan sa7an de7iya asa ubbaa bolla xillo pirdda pirddanaw qamma giigisi wothis. Iya hayqoppe denthidi hessa asa ubbaas tumayis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Enttafe issi issi asati hayqoppe denddobaa Phawuloosappe si7idi, iya bolla qelqisidosona. Shin harati, “Nuuni hessa neeppe gujjidi si7anaw koyoos” yaagidosona. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Phawuloosi entta giddofe keyis. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Shin issi issi addeti Phawuloosara gaakettidi ammanidosona. Entta giddofe Aryoospaagosan shiiquwan de7iya Diyonasyoos giya addey, Damarsso giya issi maccasiyanne harati de7oosona.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Qoronttoosa bis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Phawuloosi Ateenappe keyidi, Qoronttoosa bis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yan Aqiila giya Phanxoosan yelettida issi Ayhude asi demmis. Ayhude asay ubbay Roomeppe keyana mela kawoy Qalawudiyoosi kiittida gisho guutha wodeppe kase I ba machche Phirisqilara Xaaleppe yis. Phawuloosi enttara gayttanaw bis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Iya oosoy enttayssada dunkkaane siko gidiya gisho, enttara uttidi issife oothis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Phawuloosi Sambbaata ubban Ayhudetanne Giriketa ammanthanaw Ayhude Woosa Keethan palamees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Sillaaseynne Ximotiyoosi Maqedooniyappe yida wode Phawuloosi ba kumetha wodiya immidi Ayhudetas Yesuusi I, Kiristtoosa gidi qaala odis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin entti Phawuloosa ixxidi iya cayin Phawuloosi ba ma7uwappe baanaa qoqqofishe, “Hintte gomey hinttena oykko; taani hessan de7ikke. Hizappe guye, taani Ayhude gidonna asaakko bays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yaappe keyidi Xoossaa goynniya Titoos Yosxoosa giya uraa soo bis. Yosxoosa keethay Ayhude Woosa Keetha matan de7ees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ayhude Woosa Keetha halaqay Qarisphoosi ba soo asa ubbaara Godaa ammanis. Qoronttoosa asatappeka daroti Xoossaa qaala si7ida wode ammanidi xammaqettidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Goday issi qamma Phawuloosas qonccidi, “Yayyofa; oda, si7i gooppa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Taani neera de7ays. Taw ha kataman daro asi de7iya gisho nena qohidi iitaban yeggana asi oonikka baawa” yaagis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Phawuloosi Xoossaa qaala asaa tamaarssishe issi laythinne usuppun ageena enttara uttis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Gaaliyoosi Akkaya biittaa aysiya wode Ayhudeti issife Phawuloosa bolla denddidi pirdda keethi iya efidi, <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Ha addey higgiya ixxidi, asay Xoossaa goynnana mela oothees” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Phawuloosi haasayana hanishin, Gaaliyoosi Ayhudetakko, “Ayhudetoo, hessi iita ooso woykko naaqo gidiyakko taani hinttebaa dandda7ada si7anaw bessees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin qaalas, sunthasinne hintte higgiyas hintte palamiyabaa gidikko hinttee, hinttew billite; hessa taani pirddike” yaagis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yaatidi, entta pirdda keethafe kare kessis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Girike asay ubbay Ayhude Woosa Keetha halaqaa Sostenisa oykkidi pirdda keethaa sinthan wadhdhidosona. Shin Gaaliyoosi hessa paxabaa gibeenna.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Anxookiya bis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Phawuloosi daro gallas Qoronttoosan uttidaappe guye ammaniyaa asaa sarothidi, Phirisqiliranne Aqiilara markkaben Sooriya bis. Shin I baanappe sinthe baw gasoy de7iya gisho Kinkkiriya kataman ba huu7iya buluusettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:18">Tay 6:18</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v"/>Entti Efesoona gakkida wode Phawuloosi Phirisqilonne Aqiila yan aggis. Shin baw Ayhude Woosa Keethi gelidi Ayhudetara odettis. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Entti banttara daro wode uttana mela Phawuloosa woossidosona shin I ixxis. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Enttafe shaakettishe, “Taani yaa baaliya Yerusalaamen bonchchanaw bessees. Shin Xoossi giikko hintteko simma yaana” yaagidi Efesoonappe markkabiyan bis. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Qisaariya gakkida wode Yerusalaame bidi woosa keethaa asaa sarothidaappe guye Anxookiya bis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yan guutha wode gam77idaappe guye ammaniyaa asata ubbaa minthethishe Galaatiyaranne Firgiyara aadhdhis.</para>
  <para style="s">Aphiloosi Efesoonaninne Qoronttoosan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Iskkinddiriyan yelettida issi Aphiloosa giya Ayhude asi Efesoona bis. I oda eriya asinne Xoossaa qaala daro eriya asi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Godaa ogiyakka tamaaris, ayyaanan xuugettidi Yesuusabaa suure tamaarssees. Gidoshin, Yohaannisa xinqqatiya xalaala erees. <verse number="26" style="v"/>I Ayhude Woosa Keethan yayyonna tamaarssees. Phirisqilanne Aqiili I odeyssa si7ida wode banttara soo iya efidi Xoossaa ogiya kaseyssafe geeshshidi iyaw odidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Aphiloosi Akkaya baanaw koyin Efesoonan de7iya ammaniyaa asay iya qofaa ekkidi Akkayan de7iya ammaneysati iya mokkana mela enttaw dabddaabbiya xaafidosona. I yaa gakkida wode Xoossaa aadho keehatetha baggara Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammanidayssata daro maaddis. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ays giikko, Yesuusi I Kiristtoosa gideyssa Ayhudetas Xoossaa qaalappe qonccisidi deriya sinthan minthi odidi entta lathis.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Efesoona bis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Aphiloosi Qoronttoosan de7ishin, Phawuloosi qommo baggara aadhdhidi Efesoona bis. Yan issi issi ammaniyaa asata demmis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Enttako, “Hintte ammanida wode Geeshsha Ayyaana ekkideti?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Entti, “Akkay, ekkibookko; hari attoshin, Geeshsha Ayyaani de7iyabaakka si7ibookko” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Phawuloosi enttako, “Yaatin, aybin xammaqettidetii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Entti, “Nuuni Yohaannisa xinqqatiyan xammaqettida” yaagidi zaaridosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Phawuloosi, “Yohaannisi baappe guyera yaa Yesuus Kiristtoosan asay ammanana mela asaas odishe, nagaraappe simo bessiya xinqatiyan xammaqis” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Maato 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar 1:4</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:7-8">7-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:4">Luuqa 3:4</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:26-27">Yoha 1:26-27</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Entti hessa si7ida wode Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa tamaare gidanaw xammaqettidosona. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Phawuloosi ba kushiya entta bolla wothida wode Geeshsha Ayyaanay entta bolla wodhdhin, dumma dumma doonan odettidosona; qassi tinbbite odidosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>He bessan tammanne nam77a gidiya asati de7oosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Phawuloosi Ayhude Woosa Keetha gelidi, Xoossaa kawotethaabaa yayyonna palamishenne loythi qonccisishe enttara heedzu ageena gakkanaw gam77is. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Shin enttafe issoti issoti dhube gididi daro asaa sinthan Godaa ogiya cayidi ammanonna ixxidosona. Phawuloosi ammaneyssata enttafe shaakki ekkidi Xiraanosa giya tamaare keethan ubba gallas entta tamaarssis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Phawuloosi nam77u laythi gakkanaw qaala odis. Hessa gisho, Iisiyan de7iya asay ubbay, Ayhudetikka Ayhude gidonnayssatikka Godaa qaala si7idosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossay Phawuloosa kushen oothida malaatata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Xoossay Phawuloosa kushen wolqqaama malaatata oothis. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, asay iya bollaa bochchida maarabiya woykko ma7uwa hargganchchotas efoosona. Enttika paxoosona; tuna ayyaanatikka enttafe keyoosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Tuna ayyaanata kessishe yuuyiya Ayhudetappe issoti issoti, “Phawuloosi qaala odida Yesuusa sunthan keyite gidi hinttena kiittoos” yaagidi, tuna ayyaanati oykkida asata bolla Godaa Yesuusa sunthaa xeegidosona <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kahine halaqaa Asqeewe giya issi Ayhude addiyaas hessa oothiya laappun nayti de7oosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin tuna ayyaanay enttako, “Taani Yesuusakka Phawuloosakka erays, shin hintte oonantee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tuna ayyaanay oykkida addey entta bolla guppi wodhdhidi, entta madunxisidi, he keethafe kallo baqatana gakkanaw wolqqaamis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Efesoonan de7iya Ayhudetinne Ayhude gidonnayssati ubbay hessa si7idi daro yayyidosona. Godaa Yesuusa sunthay daro bonchchettis. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ammaneyssatappe daroti bantta oothida iita oosuwa paaxishenne qonccen odishe yoosona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Biteyssatappe daroti bantta maxaafata shiishidi asa ubbaa sinthan xuuggidosona. He maxaafata gatiya qooday ishatamu mukulu bira santime <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bira santime: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maatoosa 26:15 xeellite.</char></note> gidis. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessada hanidi Xoossaa qaalay diccishenne aakkishe bis.</para>
  <para style="s">Efesoona kataman ooshshi denddis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessi polettidaappe guye Phawuloosi, “Taani Yerusalaame ba simmada Roomekka baanaw bessees” yaagidi Maqedooniyaranne Akkayara aadhdhidi Yerusalaame baanaw qofa qachchis. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Qassi bana maaddeyssatappe nam77ata Ximotiyoosanne Erasxoosa Maqedooniya kiittidi, baw Iisiyan guutha wode gam77is.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>He wode Godaa ogiya gisho Efesoonan wolqqaama kachchi keyis. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Issi biraa oothiya Dimexiroosa giya uray Arxemiisi eeqa keethaa misiliya birappe oothidi daro wodhe demmees. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hessa mela ooso ootheyssata issife shiishidi, “Asaw, nu duretethay ha oosuwan gideyssa hintte ereeta. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hayssi Phawuloosi, ‘Asa kushen oosettidayssati xoossata gidokkona’ yaagidi, Efesoonaninne guutha biittatappe attin kumetha Iisiya ubban de7iya daro asaa odi ammanthidayssanne balethidayssa hintte be7idetanne si7ideta. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Meto gididay, nu oosoy kadhetteyssa xalaala gidonnashin, Iisiyaninne biitta ubban de7iya asi goynniya gita xoossee Arxemiisi keethay bonchchettonna atteyssanne I gitatethayka kunddanayssa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Asay hessa si7ida wode shenen xuugettidi, “Efesoona Arxemiisa gita” yaagidi waassidosona. <verse number="29" style="v"/>He waasoy katama ubbaa gakkis. Phawuloosara hamuttiya Maqedooniya asata, Gaayoosanne Arsxirokoosa oykkidi goochchishe kaassa bessaa woxxidosona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Phawuloosikka asay shiiqidasuwa gelanaw koyis, shin ammaneysati iya diggidosona. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Iisiya biittaa halaqatappe Phawuloosa lagge gidida issoti issoti Phawuloosakko kiittidi, “Kaassa bessaa qonccen keyada benttofa” gidi iya woossidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Shiiqida asaas hananabay dhays; dariya bagga asay hari attoshin ays shiiqidaakko eronna gisho, issoy issibaas waassiya wode hankkoy harabaas waassees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ayhudeti Iskkinddire giya addiya aathi bessin, issi issi asay I gaanabaa odidi iya sinthe aathidosona. I asay si7i gaana mela ba kushiyan malli bessidi, asaas mootettanaw eqqis. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Shin Iskkinddirey Ayhude asi gididayssa asay erida wode nam77u saate gidanayssa mela ubbay issi qaalan, “Efesoona Arxemiisa gita” yaagidi waassidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wurssethan Katamaa xaafey asaa si7i oothidi, “Efesoona asaw! Efesoona katamay gita Arxemiisi eeqa keethaanne saloppe wodhdhida, I shuchcha misiliya naageyssa gideyssa eronna asi baawa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hayssa kashi giya asi baynna gisho hintte si7i gaanawunne dirggidi aykko oothonna agganaw bessees. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hintte ha asata, eeqa keetha miishe kaysotiboonnayssatanne nu Xoossata cayboonayssata ehideta. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Dimexiroosinne iyara de7iya oosanchchoti asaa mootanaw koykko, pirdda keethay dooya de7ees; daynnatikka de7oosona; entti mootanaw dandda7osona. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Shin hintte hara oda koykko, Shanggo shiiqon oday be7etto. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hessa gidonna ixxiko hachchi hanidabaas Roome kawotethay nuna oychchana. Ha buqethaas gaasoy baynna gisho, nuuni gaaso odanaw dandda7okko” <verse number="41" style="v"/>yaagidi shiiquwa laallis.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Maqedooniyanne Girike bis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Waasoy deccidaappe guye, Phawuloosi ammaniyaa asata xeegisidi entta zoridaappe guye, sarothidi Maqedooniya baanaw keyis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>He biittaara aadhdhishe qaala odishe asaa daro minthethidaappe guye Girike biittaa bis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>I yan heedzu ageena uttidi, markkabera Sooriya baanaw qoppidi de7ishin, Ayhudeti bana wodhanaw koyeyssa eridi Maqedooniyara guye simmanaw koyis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Phawuloosa moyzidayssati Beeriyappe Pharhusa na7aa Sophaaxirosa, Teselonqefe Arsxirokoosanne Sikonddusa, Derbbefe Gaayoosa, Iisiyappe Tikiqoosa, Xirofimoosanne Ximotiyoosa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessati sinthe bidi nuna Xiro7aadan naagoosona. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nuuni Uytha Baaliya bonchchidaappe guye, Filphisiyuusappe markkabera denddidi, ichchashantho gallasan entta Xiro7aadan gakkidi yan laappun gallas gam77ada.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Xiro7aadan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Saaminttafe koyro gallasan nuuni uythaa menthanaw shiiqidi de7ishin, Phawuloosi wonttethe baanaw qoppida gisho, enttaw qaala odishe giddi bilahe gakkanaw odaa adussis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nuuni shiiqidi uttida pooqiyan daro poo7oy de7ees. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ewuxikoosa giya issi na7atethay maskkoote bolla uttidi, baana dogidi dhiskkis. Phawuloosi oda adussida wode Ewuxikoosi dhiskko eeyidi heedzantho pooqiyappe kunddidi hayqqidayssa asay denthis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosi wodhdhidi, iya bolla gufannis. Iya idimmidi, “I hayqqibeenna, hirggofite” yaagis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, pude pooqiya bolla keyidi uythaa menthidi mis. Sa7ay wonttana gakkanaw asaas odidaappe guye denddidi bis. <verse number="12" style="v"/>He paxida naatethaa soo efidi daro ufayttidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Xiro7aadappe Miliixe bis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosi bana yaappe mokkana mela nuus odida gisho, kasetidi markkabiyakko bidi, Asoosa baanaw denddida. Ays giikko, I tohon baanaw qoppida gisho nuna hessatho kiittis. <verse number="14" style="v"/>I nuura Asoosan gayttin markkabiyan iya ekkidi Mixiliine bida. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wonttetha gallas yaappe denddidi markkabiyan Kiyoosa sinthen de7iya bessaa gakkida; qassi wonttetha gallas Saamose pinnidi kaalliya gallas Miliixe gakkida. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Phawuloosi Iisiyan daro gam77onna Efesoona matara aadhdhanaw qoppis. Baw dandda7ettiko Phenxeqosxe Baaliya gallas Yerusalaame gakkanaw eesotees.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Efesoona cimata zoris</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Phawuloosi Miliixeppe Efesoona kiittidi woosa keethaa cimata xeegisis. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Woosa keetha cimati iyaakko yin, enttako hayssada yaagis: “Taani Iisiya gelida koyro gallasappe doomida hinttera de7ida wode ubban waana de7idaakko hintte ereeta. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ayhudeti duulatidi ta bolla meto gathikokka taani ashkketethaninne daro afuthan Godaas oothas. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Dabaabankka hintte keethan keethan hinttena tamaarssishe hinttena maaddiyabaappe issibaakka pacisabiikke. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Taani Ayhudetasinne Ayhude gidonnayssatas nagaraappe Xoossaakko simmana melanne nu Godaa Yesuusa ammanana mela markkattas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Yan tana aybi gakkaneekko erikke, shin ha77i taani Geeshsha Ayyaanas kiitettada Yerusalaame bays. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Geeshsha Ayyaanay qashoynne waayey tana naageyssa katama ubban taw maarkkattis. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Shin ta wothaa polanawunne Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosappe ekkida oosuwa, Xoossaa aadho keehatethaa Wonggelaa markkatteyssa polanaw ta shemppiw pathonnabaada qoodays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:7">2Ximo 4:7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Taani ha77ika Xoossaa kawotethaa markkattashe hintte ubbaa giddon yuuyas. Hizappe guye hinttefe oonikka tana be7onnayssa erays. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hinttefe issi uray dhayikkoka ta oyshettonayssa hachchi hinttew geeshshada odays. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ays giikko, Xoossay oothanaw qoppidabaa ubbaa hinttew aybibaakka ashshonna odas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Ba na7aa suuthan wozida Xoossaa woosa keethaa naagite. Geeshsha Ayyaanay hinttena halaqaa oothidi doorida wudiyasinne hintte huu7iyas naagettite. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Taani bidaappe guye, wudiyas qadhettonna iita suudhumeti hintte giddo gelanayssa ta erays. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ammaneyssata bantta geedo kaalethanaw worddo tamaarssiya asati hintte giddofe denddana. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, taani heedzu laythi qammanne gallas afuthan hinttena huu7en huu7en minthethidayssa qoppishe naagettite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Ha77ika hinttena minthanawunne geeshsha asaara laatisanaw dandda7iya Xoossaasinne iya aadho keehatetha qaalas hinttena hadara immays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Taani ooppekka bira woykko worqqa woykko afila amottabiikke. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Taani ta kushen oothada tananne taara de7eyssata koshshidabaa maaddidayssa hinttee, hintte huu7en ereeta. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hintte hayssada daaburidi oothishe daaburanchchota maaddanayssanne Godaa Yesuusi, ‘Ekkeyssafe immeyssi anjjettidayssa’ gida qaala hintte qoppanaw besseyssa taani hinttena ubbaban bessas” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Phawuloosi hessa odi onggidi entta ubbaara gulbbatidi Xoossaa woossis. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Entti ubbayka Phawuloosa idimmidi yeekkidi yeeridosona. <verse number="38" style="v"/>I Zaaridi, “Tana be7ekketa” yaagida qaalay entta daro azzanthis. Entti markkabiya gakkanaw iya moyzidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Yerusalaame bis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nuuni Efesoona cimatappe shaakettida mela Qoose bida. Wonttetha gallas Rooda gakkidi yaappe Phaxara bida. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Finqqe pinniya markkabie demmidi iyan gelidi baanaw denddida. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nuuni Qoophirosa be7anaw dandda7iya soo yidi, Qoophirosa haddirssa bagga aggidi Sooriya bida. Markkabey ba caanaa yan wothanaw koyida gisho Xiiroosa bida. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yan ammaniyaa asata demmidi enttara laappun gallas uttida. Phawuloosi Yerusalaame boonna mela entti iyaw Ayyaanan odidosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nuuni enttara uttiya wodey wurin keyidi bida. Entti ubbay bantta maccasataranne bantta naytara issife katamaappe kare kessidi nuna moyzidosona. Nuuni abbaa doonan gulbbatidi Xoossaa woossida. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, woli sarothidi nu markkabiyan gelida; entti bantta soo simmidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nuuni abbaa ogiya onggidi, Xiiroosappe Phexelemaysa gakkida. Yan ammaniyaa asata sarothidi, entta matan issi gallas pee7ida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wonttetha gallas keyidi, Qisaariya bida. Sabaakiya Filiphphoosa soo gakkidi iya matan uttida. I Yerusalaamen kase doorettida laappunatappe issuwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:5">Ha@O 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:5">8:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Filiphphoosas nabe gidida oyddu geela7o nayti de7oosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nuuni unddenna gallas yan uttidi de7ishin tinbbite odiya issi Agaboosa giya addey Yihudappe Qisaariya yis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:28">Ha@O 11:28</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nuukko yidi Phawuloosa saqqiya ekkidi ba kushiyanne ba tohuwa qachchidi, “Geeshsha Ayyaanay ha saqqiya godaa, Yerusalaamen Ayhudeti hayssada qachchidi, Ayhude gidonna asaas aathidi immana yaagees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nuuni hessa si7ida wode nunne yan de7iya asati Phawuloosi Yerusalaame boonna mela woossida. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosi zaaridi, “Hintte hayssada yeekkishe ays ta wozanaa shugiseeti? Taani, Godaa Yesuusa sunthaa gisho qashetetha xalaala gidonnashin Yerusalaame hayqqanawukka giigettas” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nu zoriya I ekkenna ixxin, “Godaa sheney hano” yaagidi si7i gida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yan guutha wode gam77idaappe guye giigettidi Yerusalaame baanaw keyida. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Qisaariyan de7iya ammaniyaa asatappe guuthati nuura bidosona. Entti nuuni shemppanasuwa Minaasona giya Qoophirosa addiya soo efidosona. Minaasoni koyro ammanida asaappe issuwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Yerusalaame gakkis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nuuni Yerusalaame gakkida wode ammaniyaa asati nuna ufayssan mokkidosona. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wonttetha gallas Phawuloosinne nuuni Yayqoobara gayttanaw bida. Woosa keethaa cimati ubbatikka yan de7oosona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Phawuloosi entta sarothidaappe guye Ayhude gidonna asaa giddon ba baggara Xoossay oothidabaa ubbaa enttaw odis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Entti hessa si7ida wode Xoossaa galatidi Phawuloosakko hessada yaagidosona: “Nu ishaw, Ayhudeta giddon aappun mukulati Xoossaa ammanidaakko ne be7aasa; entti ubbayka higgiya minthi naagoosona. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Neeni Ayhude gidonnayssata biittan de7iya Ayhude ubbay bantta nayta qaxxaronna mela, Ayhudeta wogaa kaallonna melanne Muse higgiya ixxana mela neeni tamaarsseyssa Yerusalaamen de7iya Ayhudeti si7idosona. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yaatin aybi lo77o? Neeni yidayssa daroti si7ana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, nuuni new odeyssa si7a; gasoy de7iya oyddu asati nu matan de7oosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23-24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:13-21">Tay 6:13-21</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v"/>Entta ekkada enttara geeya; qassi entti bantta huu7iya meedettana mela enttaw miishe imma. Entti kase nebaa si7idayssi tuma gidonnayssanne neeni ne huu7enkka higge naagiya asi gideyssa ubbay erana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Shin ammanida Ayhude gidonna asata gidikko, entti eeqas yarshshettidabaa moonna mela, suuthu uyonna mela, bawuta moonna melanne laymatonna mela, nuuni oda qachchidi, enttaw dabddaabbe xaafida” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:29">Ha@O 15:29</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Phawuloosi wonttetha gallas asata ekkidi, enttara geeyis. I bantta geeya gallasay awude polettiyakko erisanawunne bantta yarshshuwa awude yarshshaneekko erisanaw Xoossa Keethi gelis.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi oykettis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Laappun gallasay wurana hanishin, Iisiyappe yida Ayhudeti Xoossa Keethan Phawuloosa be7idi, asa ubbaa denthethidi Phawuloosa oykkidosona. <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Isra7eele asaw, nuna maaddite; ha uray, nu deriya, nu higgiyanne ha Xoossa Keetha ixxana mela asa ubbaa tamaarssees. Hessika gidonna ixxin Ayhude gidonnayssata Xoossa Keethi gelssidi, ha geeshsha bessaa tunisis” yaagidi waassidosona. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Entti hessa giday kase Efesoona Xirofimoosa Phawuloosara kataman be7ida gisho ha77i Phawuloosi Xoossa keethi iya ekki gelidabaa enttaw daanis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Ha@O 20:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Katama ubbay buqettis; asay ubbay shiiqidi Phawuloosa oykkidi Xoossa Keethafe kare goochchidosona. Xoossa Keethaa penggeti ellesidi gorddettidosona. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Asay Phawuloosa wodhana hanishin, “Yerusalaame katamay kumethi buqettis” giya oday Roome shaalaqaakko gakkis. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Shaalaqay wotaaddaretanne mato halaqata ekkidi woxxishe yis. Asay shaalaqaanne wotaaddareta be7ida wode Phawuloosa wadhdheyssa aggaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>He wode shaalaqay shiiqidi, Phawuloosa oykkidi, nam77u santhalaatan qashettana mela kiittis. Yaatidi, I ooneekkonne ay oothidaakko asaa oychchis. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Asaappe baggay issibaa gidi waassiya wode, harati harabaa gidi waasses. Waasoy darida gisho, shaalaqay tumaa shaakkanw dandda7ettonna ixxin, wotaaddareti Phawuloosa bantta de7iyaso efana mela kiittis. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Phawuloosi yedhdhi keyaa dethaa gakkiya wode asaa sugethaa gisho wotaaddareti iya tookkidosona. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Daro asay, “I hayqqo!” yaagidi waassishe kaalloosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi mootuwas zaaro immis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wotaaddareti Phawuloosa bantta de7iyasuwa gelssana hanishin, Phawuloosi shaalaqaakko, “Taani new issibaa odo?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">I Phawuloosakko, “Neeni Girike doona eray? <verse number="38" style="v"/>Neeni hayssafe sinthe buqethi medhdhidi shemppo wodhida oyddu mukulu asata ekkidi bazzo gelida Gibxe uraa gidikkii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosi, “Taani, Kilqiyan de7iya erettida Terseese kataman yelettida Ayhude asi. Hayyana tana odisarkkii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Shaalaqay iyaakko, “Oda” yaagin Phawuloosi dethaa bolla eqqidi, asay si7i gaana mela ba kushiyan mallis. Asay si7i gin Ibraysxe doonan hayssada yaagis:</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Ta ishato, ta aawato, taani ha77i hinttew immiya zaaruwa si7ite.” <verse number="2" style="v"/>Phawuloosi enttaw Ibraysxe doonan odeyssa si7idi kaseyssafe aathidi si7i gidosona. I kaallidi,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Taani Kilqiyan de7iya Terseesen yelettada ha kataman diccas. Ta asttamaareykka Gamaaliyale; taani nu aawata higgiya mintha tamaarida, hachchi hintte ubbay haneyssada Xoossaas mishettiya Ayhude asi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:34-39">Ha@O 5:34-39</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v"/>Taani ha ogiya kaalliya maccatanne addeta oykkada qasho keethan yeggashenn entta wodhisana gakkanaw waaye bessida asi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Ha@O 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessadakka, kahine halaqaynne Shanggo ubbay tabaa markkattanaw dandda7ees. Taani Damasqqon de7iya entta ishatas enttafe dabddaabbiya ekkada yan de7iya asati qashettidi seerettana mela Yerusalaame entta ehanaw yaa bas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Taani bada Damasqqo matida wode seeta gallas qopponna saloppe gita poo7oy ta yuushuwan poo7is. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Taani sa7an kundda de7ishin, ‘Saa7ola, Saa7ola, tana ays goodday?’ giya qaala si7as. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Taani zaarada, ‘Godaw, neeni oonee?’ yaagas.</para>
  <para style="p">I zaaridi, ‘Taani, neeni gooddiya Naazirete Yesuusa’ yaagis. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Taara de7eyssati poo7uwa be7idosonappe attin taw odeyssa qaala akeekibookkona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Taani, ‘Godaw, ta ay ootho?’ yaagas.</para>
  <para style="p">“Goday taakko, ‘Denddada Damasqqo ba. Neeni oothana mela Xoossay oothanaw qoppidabaa ubbay yan new odettana’ yaagis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>He wolqqaama poo7uwa gaason ta ayfey qooqin, taara de7iya asati ta kushiya oykkidi, tana goochchin Damasqqo gakkas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Damasqqon de7iya Ayhude ubbay daro bonchchiya issi Hananiya giya addey, nu higgiya bonchcheysinne Xoossaa minthi woosseyssi de7ees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hananey taakko yidi, ta matan eqqidi, ‘Ta ishaw Saa7olaa, xeella’ yaagis. Ellesada taani iya xeella aggas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“I taakko, ‘Nu aawata Xoossay neeni iya sheniya erana mela, iya xillo Na7aa be7ana melanne iya doonappe qaala si7ana mela kasetidi nena dooris. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Neeni be7idabaanne si7idabaa asa ubbaa sinthan iyaw markkattana. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ha77i ays gam77ay? Denddada xammaqetta; iya sunthaa xeegada ne nagaraappe meecetta’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Taani guye Yerusalaame simmada Xoossa Keethan woossishin, taw qonccethi benttis. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Qonccethan Goday taakko, ‘Ne taw markkattiya markkatethaa asay ekkonna gisho ellesada Yerusalaameppe keya’ yaagishin taani be7as.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Taani, ‘Godaw, Ayhude Woosa Keetha ubban nena ammaneyssata oykkada wadhdhidayssanne qasho keethan yeggidayssa entti eroosona. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Entti ne markka Isxifaanose wodhiya wode taani he odan issifas. Qassi entta matan eqqada iya wodheyssata ma7uwa naagays’ yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Ha@O 7:58</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Goday taakko, ‘Taani nena Ayhude gidonna asaakko haahoso kiittiya gisho denddada ba’ ” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Roome asi gideyssa qonccisis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Phawuloosi he qaala odidi ongana gakkanaw asay I geyssa si7oosona. Hessafe guye, bantta qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Hayssa biittafe dhayssa! I daanaw bessenna” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Entti wocamishin, bantta ma7uwa bolla holishininne baana bolla laallishin; <verse number="24" style="v"/>Shaalaqay be7idi wotaaddareti Phawuloosa bantta de7iyasuwa efana mela kiittis. Qassi asay ays hessada wocamidaakko eranaw koyidi Phawuloosa lisson garaafidi pilggana mela entta kiittis. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shin wotaaddareti Phawuloosa dafon minthi qachchidi garaafana haniya wode Phawuloosi ba matan eqqida mato halaqaakko, “Roome asi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Roome asi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">16:37 xeellite.</char></note> pirddi baynna garaafeyssi hinttew wogee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mato halaqay hessa si7ida wode shaalaqaakko bidi, “Ha addey Roome asi. Neeni ay oothanaw qoppay?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Shaalaqay Phawuloosakko shiiqidi, “Neeni Roome ase? Ane taw oda” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Phawuloosi, “Ee” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Shaalaqay zaaridi, “Taani ha gadetethaa daro miishen shammas” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Shin Phawuloosi, “Ta he gadetethaa yeletethan demma ekkas” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Phawuloosa pilgganaw qoppidayssati iira iyappe shaakettidosona. Shaalaqay Roome asi santhalaatan qachchidayssa erida wode yayyis.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Ayhudeta Shanggo sinthe shiiqis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Wonttetha gallas Shaalaqay, Ayhudeti Phawuloosa ays mootidaakko geeshshi eranaw koyis. Kahine halaqatinne shanggoy ubbay shiiqana mela kiittis; qassi Phawuloosa qashoppe bilisidi entta sinthan essis.</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Phawuloosi shiiquwa caddi xeellidi, “Ta ishato, taani hachchi gakkanaw Xoossaa sinthan ta de7o ubban lo77o wozanan de7as” yaagis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kahine halaqay Hananey, Phawuloosa doonan baqqana mela iya matan eqqidayssata kiittis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>He wode Phawuloosi iyaakko, “La ha booqqinte tiyida goda daaneysso, Xoossay nena baqqana. Neeni ta bolla higgiyatho pirddanaw uttada de7ashe higgey baynna tana baqqana mela kiitay?” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:27-28">Maato 23:27-28</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Phawuloosa matan eqqidayssati iyaakko, “Ne Xoossaa kahine halaqaa cayay?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Phawuloosi, “Ta ishato, I kahine halaqa gididayssa taani erabiikke; ays giikko Xoossaa qaalan, ‘Ne deriya ayseyssa bolla iita qaala haasayoppa’ geetetti xaafettis” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Kessa 22:28</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosi he bessan de7iya asaappe baggati Saduqaaweta, baggati Farisaaweta gideyssa be7idi, “Ta ishato, taani Farisaawenne Farisaawe na7a; ‘Hayqqidayssati hayqoppe denddana’ gada taani ufayssan naagiya gisho entti ta bolla pirddoosona” yaagidi odis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:5">Ha@O 26:5</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Fil 3:5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Phawuloosi hessa gida wode Farisaaweta giddoninne Saduqaaweta giddon ooshshi keyin shaakettidosona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ays giikko, Saduqaaweti, “Hayqqida asi denddenna; kiitanchchoyka ayyaanikka baawa” yaagosona. Shin Farisaaweti nam77ayka de7eyssa ammanoosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Maato 22:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18">Mar 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27">Luuqa 20:27</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Gita kachchi keyis; Farisaaweta bagga gidida higge asttamaareti denddi eqqidi, “Ha uraa bolla aybi balakka demmibookko; iyaw ayyaani woykko kiitanchchoy haasayonna aggenna” yaagidi palamidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ooshshay darin asay Phawuloosa shaqerethonna mela gidi, shaalaqay ba wotaaddareti wodhdhidi entta giddofe iya ellesi kessidi bantta de7iyasuwa efana mela kiittis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>He qamma Goday Phawuloosa matan eqqidi, “Phawloosaa, neeni taw Yerusalaamen markkattidaysada Roomenkka markkattanaw bessees; minna; aykkoy baawa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosa wodhanaw maqettidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Wonttetha gallas Ayhudeti, “Phawuloosa wodhonna de7ishe mookko uyokko” gidi caaqqidosona. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Phawuloosa bolla hessa maqettida asati oytamappe daroosona. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Entti kahine halaqatakkonne deriya cimatakko bidi, “Nuuni Phawuloosa wodhonna de7ishe kathi giyabaa mookko gidi caaqettida. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hiza, hinttenne shanggoy iyabaa geeshshidi pilggiyabay de7iya daanisidi, Phawuloosa hintteko ehana mela shaalaqaa oychchite. Nuuni I ha shiiquwa gakkanaappe sinthe iya wodhanaw giigidi uttida” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosa michche na7ay he maqquwa si7ida wode, bidi wotaaddareti de7iyasuwa gelidi, Phawuloosas odis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Phawuloosi mato halaqatappe issuwa xeegidi, “Ha na7ay shaalaqas odiyabay de7iya gisho iya shalaqaakko efa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mato halaqay na7aa shaalaqaakko efidi, “Qasho keethan de7iya Phawuloosi tana baakko xeegidi, ha na7ay new odiyabay de7iya gisho, iya neekko ehana mela tana woossis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Shaalaqay na7aa kushiya oykkidi, dumma kare kessidi, “Neeni taw odanabay aybe?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Na7ay shaalaqaakko, “Ayhudeti Phawuloosabaa kaseppe minthi pilgganaw koyidabaa daanisidi neeni wontto iya shiiquwa ehana mela nena woossanaw zoretaa qachchidosona. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Shin neeni entti giyabaa si7oppa. Ays giikko, oytamappe dariya asati Phawuloosa wodhonna de7ishe ‘Kathi mookko, haathe uyokko’ gidi caaqettidi, qosettidi iya naagoosona. Ha77i ne giyabaa xalaala si7anaw naagoosona” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shaalaqay zaaridi, “Ha oda ne taw odidayssa hara oodeskka odoppa” yaagidi kiittidi na7aa guye yeddis.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi deriya aysiya Filkkisa sinthe shiiqis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shaalaqay mato halaqatappe nam77ata xeegidi, “Qammafe heedzu saaten Qisaariya baanaw, nam77u xeetu wotaaddareta, laappun tammu para asatanne nam77u xeetu tooranchchota giigisite. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Deriya aysiya Filkkisakko Phawuloosa saro gathanaw toga mehe giigisite” yaagidi entta kiittis. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shaalaqay Filkisas hessada giya dabddaabbiya xaafis:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Qalawudiyoosa Luusiyosappe deriya aysiya bonchcho Filkkisas, saroy new gido. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ayhudeti ha uraa oykkidi wodhana hanishin, I Roome biitta asi gidoyssa erada wotaaddaretara gakkada iya ashshas. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Entti iya ays mootiyakko eranaw koyada entta shiiquwan iya shiishas. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Entti bantta higgiyas iya mootidayssafe attin iya wodhisiyabaa woykko qashisiyabaa gidonnayssa ta demmas. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Entti ha uraa bolla maqettida zigirssay tana gakkin, taani ellesada iya neekko yeddas. Iya mooteyssati ne sinthan bidi mootana mela kiittas” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, wotaaddareti kiitettidayssada Phawuloosa ekkidi, qamma Antiphaxirisa gathidosona. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Wonttetha gallas para asati iyara baana mela oothidi toho asati guye simmidosona. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Togay Qisaariya gakkidi dabddaabbiya deriya ayseyssas immidi, Phawuloosa iya sinthe aathidosona. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Deriya ayseyssi dabddaabbiya nabbabidaappe guye, “Phawuloosa, ne aw awuraajja asee?” gidi iya oychchis. I Kilqiya asi gidoyssa erida wode, <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Taani nebaa nena mooteyssati yaa wode si7ana” yaagis. Wotaaddareti Phawuloosa Heroodisa keethan naagana mela kiittis.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosa Ayhudeti mootidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ichchashu gallasappe guye kahine halaqay Hananey, cimataranne Xerxeluusa giya issi xabaqaara Qisaariya bis. Entti deriya ayseyssa bolla Phawuloosa mootidosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Phawuloosi xeegettidi gelida wode, Xerxeluusi iya hayssada yaagidi mootis:</para>
  <para style="p">“Bonchcho Filkkisa, nuuni ne baggara daro sarotethaa demmida, ne lo77o aysuwan nu biittay daro laamettis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Bonchcho Filkkisa, nuuni awunkka awude gidin daro galatan hessa ekkoos. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Taani nena gam77isonnashin neeni ne keehatethan nubaa qanthan si7ana mela nena woossays. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ha uray dhube gididi biitta ubban de7iya Ayhudeta giddon buqethi medhdhidi Naaziraweta bagga asaa kaaletheyssa gidoyssa erida. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hari attoshin, Xoossa Keetha tunisana hanishin nuuni iya oykkida; nu higgiyada iya bolla pirddanaw qoppida. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Shin shaalaqaa Luusiyosi yidi, wolqqan nu kusheppe iya wothi ekkis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iya mooteyssatikka neekko yaana mela kiittis. Neeni ne huu7en ha uraa filggada nuuni iya mootiya mootuwa ubbaa eranaw dandda7aasa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ayhudetikka, “Ha oday tuma” gidi iya qofaa ma77idosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi mootuwas zaaro immis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Deriya ayseyssi Phawuloosa oda gidi mallis. Phawuloosi hayssada gidi zaaris: “Neeni daro wodeppe doomada, ha asaas pirddashe de7eyssa erada ta odas ufayssan zaaro immays. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Taani Yerusalaame goynnanaw keyin tammanne nam77u gallasappe aadhdhonnayssa neeni ne huu7en eranaw dandda7aasa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ayhudeti tana Xoossaa Keethan gidin Ayhude Woosa Keethan gidin kataman gidin ooderakka palamishin woykko asa shiishada maqqishin issi asikka demmibeenna. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ha77ika entti tana mootiyabaas markka demmanaw dandda7okkona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Shin taani hayssa issibaa ammanays; taani higgen de7iyabaanne nabeti xaafida ubbabaa ammanada, nu aawata Xoossaa, entti worddo giya ogiyan goynnays. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Entti bantta huu7en ammaneyssa mela xillotinne nagaranchchoti hayqoppe denddanayssa takka ammanays. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, taani Xoossaa sinthaninne asaa sinthan ubba wode lo77o kahi taw daana mela minnays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Taani Yerusalaameppe keyoosappe daro laythafe guye ta biittaa manqotas maade immanawunne yarshsho yarshshanaw Yerusalaame bas.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:17-28">Ha@O 21:17-28</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v"/>Taani Xoossa Keethan hessa oothada geeshsha wogaa pola simmin tana demmidosona. He wode taara asi baawa, ooshshikka keyibeenna. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Shin Iisiyappe yida issi issi Ayhudeti hessan de7oosona; entti ta bolla oda koykko yidi tana ne bolla mootanaw dandda7osona. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Woykko taani shangguwa sinthe shiiqida wode oothida bali de7ikko hayssati ne sinthan de7eyssati odonna. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Taani entta giddon eqqada, ‘Hayqqidayssati denddana gada waassada odida gisho hachchi hintte sinthan ta bolla pirddoosona’ gas; hessafe harabaa oothabikke” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Ha@O 23:6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin Filkkisi Xoossaa ogiyabaa geeshshi erida gisho, “Taani hintte oda shaalaqaa Luusiyosi yaa wode pirddana” yaagidi moyzis. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Filkkisi qassi Phawuloosa qachchonna naagana melanne iya dabbotappe oonikka iya oychchanaw yishin diggonna mela mato halaqaa kiittis.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Filkkisa sinthenne Dirusilla sinthe shiiqis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Guutha gallasappe guye, Filkkisi Ayhude bagga gidida ba machche Dirusillara yidi Phawuloosa kiitti ehisidi Yesuus Kiristtoosan ammanobaa iyappe si7is. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Phawuloosi xillotethabaa, ba huu7e haariyabaanne yaanaw de7iya pirddabaa odishin, Filkkisi yayyidi, “Neeni ha77is ba; taw injjetida wode nena xeegisana” yaagis. <verse number="26" style="v"/>He wode Phawuloosappe gubbo ekkanaw qoppidi iya zaari zaari xeegisidi iyara odettees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nam77u laythafe guye, Filkkisa bessaa Phorqiyoos Fisxoosi ekkis. Filkkisi Ayhudeta ufayssanaw koyidi Phawuloosa billonna aggaa gis.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Roome Kawuwas abeet gis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Fisxoosi kawotidi heedzu gallasappe guye Qisaariyappe Yerusalaame bis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yan kahine halaqatinne Ayhudeta kaaletheyssati Phawuloosa mootidosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Phawuloosa Yerusalaame ehishin ogen qosettidi iya wodhanaw enttaw injjetana mela bantana maaddo gidi Fisxoosa woossidosona. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Fisxoosi enttako, “Phawuloosi, Qisaariyan qasho keethan de7ees; taani ta huu7enkka ellesada guye simmana hanays. <verse number="5" style="v"/>I balidabay de7ikko hintte giddon aawateyssati taara Qisaariya bidi iya mootona” yaagidi zaaris.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Fisxoosi entta matan hosppun woykko tammu gallasa mela gam77idaappe guye Qisaariya bis. Wonttetha gallas pirdda oydiyan uttidi Phawuloosa ehana mela kiittis. <verse number="7" style="v"/>I yin Yerusalaameppe yida Ayhudeti iya yuushuwan eqqidi entti lathanaw dandda7onna daro deexo mooto iya bolla shiishidosona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Phawuloosi zaaridi, “Taani Ayhude higgiya gidin Xoossa Keethaa woykko Roome Kawuwa Qeesare naaqqabiikke” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Shin Fisxoosi Ayhudeta ufayssanaw koyidi Phawuloosakko, “Yerusalaame bada ha mootuwabaa yan ta sinthan pirddettanaw koyay?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosi, “Taani pirddettanaw bessiya Qeesare pirdda keethan eqqa kichchas. Neeni loytha ereyssada taani Ayhudeta aybinkka naaqqabiikke. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hiza, taani naaqqidabay woykko hayqos gathiyabaa oothidabaa gidikko hayqoppe tana ashsha giikke. Shin entti tana mootiya mootoy mela gididaappe guye oonikka tana enttaw aathi immanaw dandda7enna. Qeesarey tabaa pirddo gada oychchays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>He wode Fisxoosi ba zoranchchotara zorettidi, “Neeni Qeesarey tabaa pirddo gada oychchadasa; Qeesarekko baasa” yaagidi zaaris.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Agriphpha sinthenne Barnniiqe sinthe shiiqis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Guutha gallasappe guye Kawoy Agriphphinne Barnniiqey Fisxoosa sarothanaw Qisaariya bidosona. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yan entti daro gallas gam77in, Fisxoosi Kawuwas Phawuloosabaa hayssada yaagidi odis; “Filkkisi billonna aggidi bida issi addey hayssan de7ees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Taani Yerusalaamen bida wode kahine halaqatinne Ayhude cimati iya bolla pirddana mela tana woossidi iyabaa taw odidosona. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Taani, ‘Mootettida uray bana mooteyssata sinthan eqqidi ba mootidabaas zaaro immonnashin, oona gidikkoka aadhdhidi imetteyssi Roome higge gidenna’ yaagada enttaw zaaras.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, entti hayssan shiiqida wode taani gam77onna wonttetha gallas pirdda keethaa gelada Phawuloosa ehana mela kiittas. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Iya mooteyssati iya matan eqqidi, iitaban iya mootonna aggokona gada taani qoppidayssa mela iya mootibookkona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Shin entti bantta ammanobaanne Phawuloosi, ‘Paxa de7ees’ giya issi hayqqida Yesuusa geetettiya addiyabaa iyara palamoosona. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ha oday tana shaakkanaw metida gisho, Phawuloosi Yerusalaame bidi, yan pirddettanaw koyakko gada iya oychchas. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosi ba oda Qeesarey iyabaa be7ana gakkanaw qasho keethan gam77anaw oychchis. Taani iya Qeesarekko yeddana gakkanaw I qashettana mela kiittas” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Agriphphi Fisxoosakko, “Taani ta huu7enkka he uray giyabaa si7anaw koyays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Fisxoosi iyaakko, “Neeni wontto I giyabaa si7ana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Wonttetha gallas Agriphphinne Barnniiqey gita bonchchon shaalaqataranne kataman de7iya gita asatara yidi pirdda keethi gelidosona. Fisxoosi Phawuloosa xeegisidi ehis. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Fisxoosi, “Kawaw Agriphpha, hayssan nuura de7iya asaw, Ayhudeti Yerusalaamenkka hayssankka waassidi, ‘I hizappe guye paxa daanaw bessenna’ yaagidi, tana woossida uraa hayssa be7eeta. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shin iya hayqos gathiyabaa aybibaakka taani demmabiikke. I ba huu7en, ‘Qeesarey tabaa pirddo yaagada oychchays’ gida gisho, Qeesarekko iya yeddanaw qofa qachchas. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Taani iyabaa ta godaa Qeesares xaafanaw gidiya gaasoy aybikka baawa. Hessa gisho, iyabaa hintte be7ikko ta xaafiyabay benttaneekko gada hintte sinthe ubbarakka Kawaw, Agriphpha, ne sinthe iya ehas. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ays giikko, qashettida asi bolla daynnas aathiya wode I ays mootettidaakko Qonccisonna aggeyssi taw eeyatethi daanees” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Agriphpha sinthan zaarida zaaruwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Agriphphi Phawuloosakko, “Neeni nebaa odanaw dandda7aasa” yaagis. He wode Phawuloosi ba kushiya denthidi hayssada yaagis:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Kawaw, Agriphpha, Ayhudeti tana mootidabaas zaaro immanaw hachchi ne sinthan eqqashe ta qaaday lo77o gada qoppays. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Neeni Ayhude woganne palamaa loythada eriya gisho tana salettonna si7ana mela nena woossays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Taani na7atethafe doomada ta asaa giddoninne Yerusalaamen de7ida ta de7uwa Ayhude ubbay eroosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Taani koyroppe doomada, nu ammano higgiya minthidi naagiya Farisaaweta yaraappe gideyssa entti markkattanaw koykko eroosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Ha@O 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Fil 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ha77ika taani Xoossay nu aawatas immana gida ufayssaa naagiya gisho mootettada hayssan eqqas. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Qassi tammanne nam77u nu aawata sheeshay Xoossaa qammanne gallas minthidi goynnishe Xoossay immana gidayssa ekkanaw ufayssan naagoosona. Kawaw Agriphpha, Ayhudeti tana mootey taani ufayssan hessa naagiya gishossa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ayhudetoo, Xoossay hayqqidayssata dentheyssa ays ammanekketii?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Kase taani ta huu7enkka Naazirete Yesuusa sunthaa teqqanaw dandda7ettidaba ubbaa oothanaw bessees gada qoppas.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:9-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Ha@O 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">22:4-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v"/>Taani Yerusalaamen oothiday hayssa. Kahine halaqatappe maata ekkada Xoossaa asatappe darota qashisas. Entta wodhiya wodekka entta hayquwa dosas. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Daro wode Ayhude Woosa Keethaa ubban entti seerettana melanne Yesuusa cayidi kaddana mela un77ethas. Taani wogi baynna entta hanqettada hari attoshin, hara biitta katamata gakkanaw entta goodas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Taani ha odas kahine halaqatappe maatanne kiitaa ekkada Damasqqo bays. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kawaw, taani seeta gallas ogiyan de7ishin awa poo7oppe daro aadhdhiya poo7oy ta yuushuwaninne taara beyssata yuushuwan saloppe poo7is. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nuuni ubbayka sa7an kunddida wode Ibraysxe doonan, ‘Saa7ola, Saa7ola, tana ays goodday? Neeni nena caddiya xam77a qakkiko nena qohasa’ yaagidi taw odishin si7as.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Taani, ‘Godaw, neeni oonee?’ yaagas.</para>
  <para style="p">“Goday, ‘Taani, neeni gooddiya Yesuusa; <verse number="16" style="v"/>shin dendda eqqa. Hachchi neeni tana be7idayssaninne sinthafe ta new bessanyssa haratas markkattana mela ta oosanchcho oothada nena shuumanaw new benttas. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Isra7eele asatappenne taani nena enttako kiittiya Ayhude gidonnayssatappe nena ashshana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Neeni entta ayfiyaa dooyana, dhumappe poo7okko, Xalahe kusheppe Xoossako entta zaarana. Entti tanan ammanidi nagara atotethaa ekkana. Xoossay doorida asaa giddon bantta laata demmana’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Kawaw Agriphpha, hessa gisho, taw saloppe benttida qonccethas kiitettanayssa ixxabiikke. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Shin taani koyrottada Damasqqon hessafe guye Yerusalaameninne Yihuda biitta ubban de7eyssatinne Ayhude gidonnayssati bantta nagaraappe Xoossaakko simmana melanne nagaraappe simuwa bessiya ooso oothana mela qaala odas.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:20">Ha@O 9:20</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:28-29">28-29</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Ayhudeti tana Xoossa Keethan oykkidi wodhanaw koyidosona. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hachchi gakkanaw Xoossaa maadey taappe shaakettibeenna; yaaniya gisho, guuthaasinne gitaas markkattashe hayssan eqqas. Nabetinne Musey hanana gidi odidayssafe haraa issibaakka taani odidabay baawa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hessika, ‘Kiristtoosi waaye ekkanaw bessees; qassi hayqoppe koyro denddidi Ayhudetasinne Ayhude gidonnayssatas atotetha poo7o odanaw bessees’ gidayssa” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:20">1Qoro 15:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Phawuloosi hessa yaagidi zaarishin, Fisxoosi ba qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Phawloosaa, ne gooyadasa; ne daro timirttey nena gooshshas gathis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosi, “Bonchcho Fisxoosaa, taani tumaabanne bessiyabaa odaysippe attin gooyabiikke. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Taani qonccen odiya odaa Kawoy erees. Ha oday geeman oosettiboonna gisho issoykka iyappe geemmonayssa taani geeshshada erays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Kawaw Agriphpha, neeni nabeta ammanaasa gidikkii? Neeni ammaneyssa taani erays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kawoy Agriphphi, Phawuloosakko, “Ha guutha saaten tana ammanthanaw koyay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Phawuloosi, “Daro wode gidin guutha wode ne xalaala gidonnashin hachchi taana si7iya ubbay ha qashuwappe attin ta mela gidana mela Xoossaa woossays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Kawoy Fisxoosi, Barnniiqeynne enttara uttida ubbayka denddidosona. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yaappe keyidi bishe issoy issuwara, “Ha uray hayqos woykko qashos gathiyabaa aykkoka oothibeenna” yaagidi odettidosona. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Agriphphi Fisxoosakko, “Ha uray ‘Qeesarey tabaa pirddo’ goonnaako bilettanaw dandda7ees shin” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Roome bis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nuuni markkaben Xaale baanaw qachchida wode Awugisxoosa wotaaddareta geetetteyssatappe issi Yuuliyoosa giya mato halaqaas Phawuloosanne hara guutha qasho asata aathi iyaw immidosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Iisiya gaxan de7iya biittata biya Adiramixiyoone markkaben gelidi denddida. Maqedooniya asi gidida Teselonqe Arsxirokoosi nuura de7ees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Wonttetha gallas nuuni Sidoona gakkishin, Yuuliyoosi Phawuloosas keehidi ba laggetakko bidi koshshiyaban maaddana mela enttako iya yeddis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yaappe denddidi sinthara nu bolla carkkiya gisho haathan teqettida biittaa, Qoophirosan zemppidi aadhdhida. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kilqiyanne Phinfiliya matan de7iya abbaa pinnidi Liiqiyan de7iya Muura gakkida. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yan mato halaqay Xaale biya Iskkinddiriya markkabe demmidi, iyan nuna gelssis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nuuni daro gallas loddara bidi, daro meton Qanidoosa katama mati gakkida. Yaara baanaw nuna carkkoy diggin Salmoonara aadhdhidi haathan teqettida biittaa, Qarxeesen zemppidi aadhdhida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Daro meton gaxa gaxa oykkidi Laasiya katamaa matan de7iya abbaa doonan “Markkabey Woppu Gidi Shemppiyaso” giya bessaa gakkida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nuuni yan daro wodiya gam77idaappe guye xoomay bilettida gisho hizappe markkaben buussi metiya gisho Phawuloosi entta zoris. <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Asaw, nu buussan gita boshinne daro qohoy de7eyssi taw benttees; qohoy caanaa bollanne markkabiya bolla xalaala gidonnashin nu de7uwa bollaka gakkana” yaagis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shin mato halaqay Phawuloosi gidayssafe aathidi markkabiya laaggeysinne markkabiya goday geyssan ammanis. <verse number="12" style="v"/>He abbaa doonan de7iya katamay balggo ageena aathanaw enttaw injjetonna gisho, dariya asati banttaw dandda7ettiko Finqqe katamaa gakkidi balggo ageena yan aathanaw zorettidosona. Finqqey pudeha-wulohappenne dugeha-wulohappe giddon abbaa doonan de7iya katama.</para>
  <para style="s">Abbaa bollan gotey denddis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kawushsha dugeha carkkoy loddara carkkida wode bantta qoppidayssada hanidabaa enttaw daanin denddidi, markkabey qaaxxonna mela oykkiya biraata pude ekkidi Qarxeese matara aadhdhidosona. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin daro gam77onna “Awuraqiis” giya wolqqaama gotey haathan teqettida biittaafe duge entta bolla denddis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>He gotey markkabiya sugidi efonna diggida gisho carkkoy markkabiya ba dosida soo efis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nuuni Qeeda giya haathan teqettida biittaa zemppidi bishe daro metootettidi markkabiya wogoluwa ashshanaw dandda7ida. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Entti wogoluwa pude kessidaappe guye wodoruwan markkabiya bolla xaaxidi, minthi qachchidosona. Surtiisa giya shafiyan banttana dom77ethana gidi hirggidi, markkabiya sharaa wodhisidi markkabiya coo yeddi aggidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Gotey wolqqaamishe bin wonttetha gallas caanaappe baggaa abban holo oykkidosona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Heedzantho gallas markkabiya miishiya ekkidi bantta kushen holidosona. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nuuni daro gallas awa ayfenne xoolintto be7onna gishonne wolqqaama uushoy nu bolla uushida gisho sinthafe nuuni shemppora attana gidi qoppibookko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>He wode entti daro gallas kathi moonna gam77ida gisho Phawuloosi entta giddon denddi eqqidi, “Asaw, hintte ta zoriya ekkidi Qarxeeseppe denddonna aggidaako ha metoynne qohoy nuna gakkenna. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin taani hinttena yayyofite gada zorays; ays giikko, ha markkabe dhayanaappe attin hinttefe issi asa shemppoykka dhayenna. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Zine qamma ta iyabaa gididayssinne ta goynniya Xoossay kiittida kiitanchchoy ta matan eqqidi, <verse number="24" style="v"/>‘Phawuloosa, yayyofa; neeni Roome biittaa Kawuwa Qeesare sinthan eqqanaw bessees. Hekko Xoossay ne gisho neera biya asa ubbaa shemppuwa ashshis’ yaagis. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, asaw, yayyofite. He kiitanchchoy taw odidayssi hananayssa taani ammanays. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Shin carkkoy nuna efidi issi haathan teqettida biittaa gaxan holana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Tammanne oyddantho qamman Meditiraane Abban nuna carkkoy gedenne haa sugishin, gidi bilahe gidiya wode markkabiyan ootheyssati biittako matidabaa daanis. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Entti ciimmotethaa eranaw koyidi wodoro xeeran deexiyabaa qachchidi abban yeggin, abbay hosppun tammu wadha gidis. Guuthi gam77idi, zaari yeggin usuppun tammu wadha gidis. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Entti abbaa gaxan de7iya shuchchan dom77ettona mela yayyidi, markkabey boonna mela oykkiya oyddu biraatata markkabiyappe guyera abban yeggidi, sa7ay wonttana mela Xoossaa woossosona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Markkabiyan ootheyssati markkabiyappe baqatanaw koyidi, markkabey boonna mela oykkiya biraatata markkabiyappe sintha baggara abban yeggiya daanin wogoluwa abban yeggidosona. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Phawuloosi mato halaqaakkonne wotaaddaretakko, “Hayssati markkabiyan shemppi uttonna ixxiko hintte attanaw dandda7ekketa” yaagis. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, wotaaddareti wogoloy qashettida wodoruwa qanxidi yeddi aggidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Sa7ay wonttana hanishin ubbay kathi maana mela Phawuloosi asaakko, “Hintte kathi moonna naagishe hachchira tammanne oyddu gallas gam77ideta. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, guutha kathi hintte maana mela taani hinttena woossays. Hintte gashttana mela guutha kathi maanaw koshshees; hari attoshin hintte huu7e binaanaappe issoykka dhayenna” yaagis. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Phawuloosi hessa gidi uythi ekkidi ubbaa sinthan Xoossaa galatis; uythaa menthidi muusu doomis. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ubbay minettidi banttaw kathi ekkidi midosona. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nuuni markkabiyan de7eyssati nam77u xeetanne laappun tammanne usuppuna. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Entti midi kallida wode caana gisttiya abban yeggidi markkabiya deexuwa kawushshidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Markkabey me77is</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Sa7ay wonttida wode markkabiya oosanchchoti aw biitta gakkidaakko eronashin, abbaa gaxan de7iya shafenne silimo be7idosona. Banttaw dandda7ettiko markkabiya he shafiyakko shiishanaw qoppidosona. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yaatidi, markkabey boonna mela oykkiya biraatata birshshidi abban yeggidosona. He wode laaggiya mithaa qachchiya wodoruwa birshshidosona. Hessafe guye, carkkoy markkabiya sinthe sugana mela markkabiya efiya sharaa sintha baggara dhoqqu oothidi buussu doomidosona. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Shin markkabey shafe dooren dom77ettidi mitettis. Markkabiyas sintha baggay xuggunidi shafiya caddi oykkidi qaaxxonna ixxin, guye baggay zuliya sugethan meqeretethi oykkis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Wotaaddareti qasho asaappe issoykka haathaa wadhdhidi kessi ekkonna mela entta wodhanaw zorettidosona. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Shin mato halaqay Phawuloosa ashshanaw koyidi wotaaddareta zoretaa ixxis. Haathe wadho eriya ubbay markkabiyappe haathan guppi guppi wodhdhidi kasetidi gaxa keyana mela kiittis. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Attidayssati sanqqaa bollanne, markkabiya me7uwa bolla keyana mela kiittis. Hessada hanidi ubbay gaxa sarora keyidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Maltta giya haathan teqettida biittaa bis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nuuni gaxa saro keyida wode gakkida haathan teqettida biittay Maltta geetetteyssa erida. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Maltta asay nuus daro keeha keehidosona. Iri bukkiya gishonne meeggiya gisho tama eethidi nuna ubbaa mokkidosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Phawuloosi daro afira shiishidi taman wothishin, shooshi seelaa gisho keyidi iya kushiya bolla xaaxettidi iya dukkis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Maltta asay shooshi Phawuloosa kushen xaaxettidayssa be7ida wode issoy issuwako, “Tuma ha uray shemppo wodhida asi; hari attoshin abbaafe I attinkka xoossa pirddafe <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">xoossa pirddafe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">He wode he biittan dumma dumma macca xoossati de7oosona. Enttafe issiniya iita oothiya asaa pirddiyaro. Iya pirdda xoossi geetetta xeegettasu.</char></note> attidi paxa daanaw dandda7ibeenna” yaagidosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Shin Phawuloosi ba kushiyappe shooshaa wuxarkkidi, taman yeggis; iya aykkoka qohibeenna. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Entti, “Iya bollay kixxees, woykko akeekonna kunddidi hayqqees” gidi iya naagoosona. Shin daro wode naagidi iya bollan aybikka dummattidabay dhayin, “Hessi xoosse” yaagidi bantta qofaa laammidosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>He heeran haathan teqettida biittaa halaqay Pupliyoosa geyssas gadey de7ees; heedzu gallas gakkanaw i nuna siiqon mokkis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pupliyoosa aaway qoxo, mishanne ulo uttison harggettidi zin77idi de7ees. Phawuloosi iya soo gelidi iyaw Xoossaa woossis; ba kushiya iya bolla wothidi pathis. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Maltan de7iya harggiya hara asatikka yidi paxidosona. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Entti nuna daro bonchcho bonchchidosona; nuuni markkaben baanaw denddida wode oges koshshiyabaa nuus immidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Malttafe Roome bis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Heedzu ageenappe guye, Maltan balggo aathida Iskkinddiriya markkaben baanaw denddida. He markkabiya bolla Diyosqoroosa giya mentte eeqata misiley de7ees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Sirakuuse giya katamaa gelidi yan heedzu gallas uttida. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yaappe denddidi Regiyume giya katamaa gakkida. Issi gallasappe guye, dugeha bagga carkkoy carkkin, wonttetha gallas Putiyoole giya katamaa gakkida. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yan nuuni issi issi ammaniyaa asata demmin, banttara saamintta gam77ana mela nuna woossidosona. Hessafe guye, Roome bida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Roomen de7iya ammaniyaa asati nubaa si7idi, Afiyoosa Giyaan, Heedzu Aqiyaso giya bessaa gakkanaw nuna mokkanaw yidosona. Phawuloosi entta be7ida wode Xoossaa galatidi minettis.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Roomen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nuuni Roome gelida wode Phawuloosi bana naagiya wotaaddariyara barkka de7o geetettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Heedzu gallasappe guye, Phawuloosi Ayhudeta halaqata baakko xeegisis. Entti shiiqida wode enttako, “Ta ishato, taani nu asaa woykko nu aawata wogaa bolla aybi qohokka oothabiikke, shin tana Yerusalaamen qachchidi Roome asaas aathidi immidosona. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Entti ta mootuwa be7idi hayqos gathiyabaa ta bolla aybibaakka demmiboonna gisho tana billanaaw qoppidosona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Shin Ayhudeti hessa ixxida wode, ‘Tabaa Qeesarey pirddo’ yaagasippe attin taani ta deriya mootiyabay de7in gidenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:11">Ha@O 25:11</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Taani hinttena xeegisiday hinttena be7anawunne hinttew hayssa odanaassa. Taani ha santhalaatan qashettiday Isra7eele asay naagiya ufayssaa gishossa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ayhude halaqati Phawuloosakko, “Nuus Yihudappe nebaa xaafettida dabddaabbey gakkibeenna. Yaappe yida asatappe issoykka nebaa iita odiday baawa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin ha ne kaalliya ammanuwa dumma dumma bessan asay ixxeyssa nuuni eriya gisho ne qofaa si7anaw koyoos” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Entti bantta yaana gallas Phawuloosas qaxaridi, he gallas daridi i de7iyasuwa yidosona. I wonttafe omarssi gakkanaw Xoossaa kawotethaabaa enttaw markkattis. Qassi entti Yesuusabaa ammanana mela Muse higgiyafenne nabeta maxaafappe qonccisidi entta tamaarssis. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Issoti issoti Phawuloosi gidayssa ammanidosona, shin harati ammanibookkona. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Entti bantta giddon oda ma77onna ixxida wode Phawuloosi issibaa gidaappe guye bidosona. I hayssada yaagis: “Geeshsha Ayyaanay nu aawatas nabiya Isayaasa doonan odidayssi tuma.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>‘Neeni he asaakko bada,</para>
  <para style="q">hintte sissaa si7eeta, shin hinttew gelenna;</para>
  <para style="q">hintte be7o be7eeta, shin demmeketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:26-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa 6:9-10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ays giikko, ha deriya wozanay muumis;</para>
  <para style="q">entta haythay tullis;</para>
  <para style="q2">entta ayfeykka goozettis.</para>
  <para style="q">Hessi baynneeko,</para>
  <para style="q2">entti bantta ayfiyaan be7idi, bantta haythan si7idi, bantta wozanan akeekidi,</para>
  <para style="q1">entti taakko simmana;</para>
  <para style="q2">takka entta pathanashin’ yaaga” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Hiza, hayssi Xoossaa atotethaa kiitay Ayhude gidonnayssatas gideyssa ereeta. Enttika si7ana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Phawuloosi hessa gidaappe guye, Ayhudeti bantta giddon daro palamishe keyidi bidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Phawuloosi kera keethan nam77u laythi kumethi de7is; yan de7ishe baakko yaa ubbaa mokkees. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yashshi baynnanne oonikka diggonnashin Xoossaa kawotethaabaa sabbakis; Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosabaa qonccisidi tamaarssees.</para>
  <para style="restore">02-Oct-2008@09:05, Backup Description=23-Sep-2008@16:55, Ed Owen -</para>
</usx>
